      "oracle": "Audit1904 retires the changed-selector receipt. The reduced source set has no current validated oracle; prior source requirements are historical until fresh execution. Historical prior account (preserved verbatim): Invoke the renderer close entry through a real SQLite Store, freeze and reopen the database, then invoke the registered paired terminal.create handler with the original tab/leaf hints and no command. Both local and runtime-spill close records must return tab_not_found with zero controller spawns and zero inventory reads, and no restored layout. Fresh identities, existing panes without a close record and expired records must still spawn.",
