        "Audit3984 retires all four remaining viewport-fixture suites (14 authored/15 finite cases) and the fixture after composing the sender-host deletion. Accepted source-alarm losses include live-region/disclosure continuity, task/question/approval history and revision handling, stale turn status, prompt-dismissal remount/rebind, and pending-send cancellation when approval arrives between body and Enter. No equivalent replacement or fresh runtime validation is claimed.",
