        "Audit1908 removes the complete prompt-presentation hook and literal interactive-protocol mapping suites and narrows the interactive card and prompt-card input suites. Lost alarms include replacement approval A settling after answered B; collapse/expand composer ownership and partial-answer presentation; identical new waits after an unmounted view; collapsed transcript re-reads; answered/dismissed status-backed persistence and retirement; and literal answer-to-PTY byte arrays. The retained stale-PTY acknowledgment, cancellation/answer retry, and answered-approval remount/rebind assertions remain meaningful but are not equivalent replacement coverage. No fresh reduced-selector result, physical provider, rendered/native-focus, mixed-version deployment, soak, or measured-budget validation is claimed. The unchanged wire-codec receipt remains valid only for its exact command. Exact retired direct alarms: 'ignores approval A settling after answered replacement B'; 'replaces the composer and hides only once the choice was delivered'; 'keeps the card answerable when the choice was refused or its delivery is unknown'; 'collapses the approval on %s without writing, until a new wait shows it again'; 'shows a second approval with the same text once it is a new wait'; 'routes question Cancel to rejection and releases the composer slot without Stop'; 'cannot collapse a question while its answer is still being written'; 'keeps the question when its Cancel was not delivered'; 'keeps a verified send visible until delivery succeeds'; 'restores a verified send for retry when delivery is rejected'; 'stays dismissed after answering while the transcript call is still pending'; 'clears once the FIFO tool result lands'; 'retains terminal choices across an agent notice until legacy human input'; 'filters Q1 before grouping Q2 and never writes Cancel, including window movement'; 'resets an edited pending form without unmounting its answer owner'; 'underlines an existing file in the plan and opens it through the chat'; 'shows an identical question again in a new wait that arrived while the view was unmounted'; 'keeps a collapsed transcript question collapsed while the transcript re-reads'; 'keeps a partly answered question across collapse and expand, and Escape in its text field'; 'keeps one line per question with a blank middle answer (3 questions)'; 'single-select: sends the picked option NUMBER (not the label), no trailing Enter'; 'single-select free text: opens \"Type something\" then types the answer + Enter'; 'multi-select: toggles each option NUMBER, then steps to Submit and confirms'; 'multi-question: steps past an unanswered question then submits'; 'preview single-select: focuses the option number, notes free text, then commits with Enter'; \"submits the final multi-question option without Claude's extra Enter\"; 'adds free text as notes before committing the selected row'; \"targets Codex's synthetic None-of-the-above row for a custom answer\"; 'clears skipped rows and confirms the partial answer once'; 'keeps a status-backed answer hidden for a remounted view'; 'shows an identical question again once the prompt cleared'; 'forgets the dismissal when its tab retires'.",
