        "Mobile owner-layout policy retires whole tests and mixed registrations without equivalent replacement coverage. Retained callbacks and reduced selectors need fresh execution at their stated scope; prior measurements do not validate them. Affected sources: mobile/src/session/mobile-prompt-controller.test.ts, tests/e2e/native-chat-ssh-delivery.unit.test.ts, mobile/src/session/native-chat/use-mobile-native-chat-controller.test.ts, mobile/src/session/native-chat/input/use-mobile-native-chat-cancel-ask.test.ts, mobile/src/session/native-chat/input/use-mobile-native-chat-answer-send.test.ts, mobile/src/session/native-chat/transcript/use-mobile-native-chat-message-send.test.ts.",
        "Historical assertion references before mobile owner-layout policy; removed references have no replacement claim: [{\"file\":\"src/renderer/src/components/native-chat/prompts/NativeChatInteractiveCard.test.tsx\",\"assertions\":[\"ignores a raw acknowledgment from a rebound PTY\",\"sends only one cancellation, can cancel an answer, and permits retry after unknown\"]},{\"file\":\"mobile/src/session/native-chat/MobileNativeChatView.prompt-presentation.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"a late answer cannot reshow an answered replacement occurrence\",\"a late answer cannot dismiss a replacement session\"]},{\"file\":\"mobile/src/session/mobile-prompt-controller.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"finishes an older-host selector once and dismisses it like an acknowledged answer\",\"dismisses older-host approval choice %i like an acknowledged answer and restores Send\",\"retains permission choices on %s\",\"acknowledges the same pending %s after a view-only toggle\",\"shows a collapsed prompt again as a new wait\",\"keeps an acknowledged Deny hidden after the chat screen remounts on a lingering status\",\"drops an accepted result after real %s replacement\",\"keeps an agent notice answerable and retires only human input through the %s view\",\"retains exact cancelled calls through edits, prefix/ID replay, paging and new equal rows (%s)\",\"keeps structured %s admission separate from captured Cancel and delivered rows\",\"settles the terminal answer for Q1 after Q2 arrives without hiding Q2\",\"fences a late captured structured answer after %s replacement\",\"does not turn real %s host-result conversion into an answered question\",\"keeps later same-ID Cancel after eviction/reentry and old answer settlement\",\"keeps structured answer controls after a thrown send\",\"isolates equal portable IDs on two hosts and rejects the old host callback\"]},{\"file\":\"tests/e2e/native-chat-ssh-delivery.unit.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"serializes every chunk of a healthy large SSH answer befo