      "coverageNotes": "Audit1650 removes low-value test projections, mock wiring, private-state assertions, inventories and duplicate examples without equivalent replacement coverage. Per-source reviews record retained public behavior and refusal boundaries with injected/native/remote limits. Affected historical receipts are retired; gates without active current evidence are downgraded. Historical scope before this audit: Production SQLite and reducer tests on macOS. Execution-host-local storage behavior is shared by remote runtimes; no live SSH or Windows/Linux run. PTY, daemon, WSL process launch, transport framing and mobile rendering are unaffected. Test-value audit1293 removes src/main/native-chat/agent-session-wire/agent-session-history-forward-read-budget.test.ts (1 authored cases). Their isolated assertions no longer run; surviving tests are not claimed as equivalent coverage. Fresh execution against the candidate SHA is required. Audit1302: src/main/native-chat/agent-session-journal/journal-streaming-replay.test.ts: Keep actual SQLite replay classification of future versions, first sequence damage and missing epoch against independent literal state/damage expectations. Remove GC/heap thresholds and private reducer-call counters plus same-connection PASSIVE checkpoint busy checks, which do not demonstrate an independently blocked checkpoint. Lose assembled replay memory/snapshot scheduling alarms; no equivalent replacement. Reduced selectors require fresh validation; prior full-suite receipts do not validate removed or changed coverage. No equivalent replacement or physical-provider claim. Audit1345: focused Linux unit execution now validates this primary selector on source head de234fc7b4a73eda58dd0084bc9e064b5d1191e0. Historical platform statements above describe earlier receipts. Removed fixture/matrix/call-count alarms are intentional losses with no equivalent replacement; no live SSH, physical-provider, p95 or cross-platform claim. Audit1371 removes synthetic receipt callback choreography and single/batch timestamp comparison from journal-row-writer.spec.ts. Actual SQLite duplicate-insert rollback/reuse and batch atomicity callbacks remain unchanged. The old directory-selected receipt is historical and does not validate this reduced selector. No equivalent replacement claim. Audit1372: current Linux unit selection passed on source head 9b07e8f1bea37bba70c78df2f9a238ea31d1be7e. Exact selectors and execution command are recorded in the new receipt. Intentional test losses remain in knownGaps; no replacement, live provider, native input, rendered E2E, performance threshold or soak coverage is claimed. Audit1379 changes src/main/native-chat/agent-session-journal/journal-atomic-settlement-oversized.spec.ts (1 authored registrations removed; 1 retained); src/main/native-chat/agent-session-journal/queued-message-edit-leases.test.ts (10 authored registrations removed; 1 retained); src/main/native-chat/agent-session-journal/journal-subagent-item.spec.ts (4 authored registrations removed; 1 retained). Intentional losses: Loses production batch-cap/cursor-count fallback expectations; retained case checks real database rollback and successful retry, with once-per-startup variants. Intentionally removes 10 authored registrations: 'a repeated acquire answers the same lease without extending it'; 'acquire refuses a card that is gone or whose text moved on'; 'reuses an edit key only after its previous target becomes invalid'; 'expires on its own and wakes the queue with no other activity'; 'renewal extends the deadline; a lapsed lease is not revived'; 'release frees only the exact caller and edit, never another editor on the same card'; 'every read re-derives: a card whose %s holds nothing'; 'a save retires every lease on the card; others stay'; 'reads the rows it is given inside a transaction'; 'dispose drops every lease and deadline; a closed handle grants none'. Retained focused cases are not claimed as equivalent replacement for these losses. Loses identity/schema/constant/field-bound and generic revision/turnScope persistence controls; retained recovery checks structured and legacy text twins. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. Existing exact primary-selector receipts and primary claims remain scoped to their unchanged sources; the broad optional selector has no new execution result. Audit1390: src/main/native-chat/agent-session-journal/journal-submission-positions.spec.ts reduced. Standalone history-page submitted-sequence projection alarm removed. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. The existing primary-selector receipt and its claims remain scoped to their unchanged sources; the broad optional command has no new execution result. Audit1392: src/main/native-chat/agent-session-journal/journal-payload-bounds-retention.test.ts reduced. Retires hand-copied UTF-8 clipping implementation comparison loops and deterministic random differential replay. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. The existing primary-selector receipt and its claims remain scoped to their unchanged sources; the broad optional command has no new execution result. Audit1396: src/main/native-chat/agent-session-journal/command-receipt-schema.spec.ts reduced. Fresh receipt schema physical layout no longer independently enumerated. src/main/native-chat/agent-session-journal/journal-unsent-send-hold-queue.spec.ts reduced. Source-present versus source-absent folded property shape loses one separate assertion. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. The existing primary-selector receipt and its claims remain scoped to their unchanged sources; the broad optional command has no new execution result. Audit1400: src/main/native-chat/agent-session-journal/command-receipt-transaction.spec.ts reduced. Lose the standalone handcrafted deletion-transaction characterization; actual journal replacement retained. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. The existing primary-selector receipt and its claims remain scoped to their unchanged sources; the broad optional command has no new execution result. Audit1401: src/main/native-chat/agent-session-journal/journal-atomic-settlement-oversized.spec.ts removed. Loses oversized atomic-settlement rollback and replay/idempotence alarms. src/main/native-chat/agent-session-journal/journal-atomic-terminal-settlement.spec.ts reduced. Driver registration/import of a whole-deleted selected spec is removed; directly authored cases remain unchanged. No extra authored removal credit. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. The existing primary-selector receipt and its claims remain scoped to their unchanged sources; the broad optional command has no new execution result. Audit1739 removes 53 of 118 authored journal/wire definitions, including 11 entire files and four driver registrar imports. Lost alarms include projection/schema tables, cursor helper branches, weak stale-liveness properties, standalone first-damage/missing-epoch diagnostics and narrow persistence copies. Retained callbacks are unchanged; this removal is not equivalent replacement coverage. Focused candidate execution is recorded separately and does not establish performance, red/green, CI soak, live providers, remote execution or cross-platform coverage.",
