      "oracle": "No current automated execution oracle is claimed for this gate after Audit1342 retired changed-source receipts. Historical oracle account: Two 5,000-frame bursts using exclusively BEL or ST produce every expected payload and ordinary output byte with at most twice the input length in the counted indexOf, charCodeAt and RegExp.exec search ranges. This is a deterministic primitive-search regression alarm, not a total CPU or memory cost model. Every split through prefixes/JSON/ST, independent parser interleaving, exact pending-cap boundaries and oversized complete frames retain bounded parser checks. Parsed output chunks are not retained in legacy regular-expression state.",
