en pane deferring one-row repaint until reveal loses this direct alarm.; puts the row back once the host confirms the short grid, not when the client sent it — Short-grid host confirmation gating row restoration loses this direct alarm.; does not take the size back from a viewer that claimed it mid-repaint — A viewer claiming geometry mid-repaint preventing old-size restoration loses this direct alarm.; leaves a swapped-out PTY alone when its nudge is still pending — Swapped-out PTY avoiding a pending repaint nudge loses this direct alarm.; puts the row back when the pane unmounts mid-repaint — Unmount during repaint restoring the nudged row loses this direct alarm.; recovers $name live output when the deadline interrupts an answered snapshot — Answered-snapshot deadline interruption under overflow/small/partial/split-escape/styled/styled-gap/unmapped/unhide-gap/fresh-gap live output loses nine direct recovery examples.; [invariant] reconciles the retained bytes through the deferred post-flood repaint — Queue-overflow quiet abandonment later reconciling retained bytes or disclosing loss loses this direct invariant alarm.; [invariant] keeps recovery armed while the user reads scrollback — Recovery remaining armed during scrollback reading/background stint then following output loses this direct invariant alarm.; [invariant] reconciles the retained bytes after the iteration backstop fires — Iteration-cap quiet abandonment owing later reconciliation/disclosure loses this direct invariant alarm.; does not leave a parked repaint after a repeated episode is repaired — Repeated repaired episode not leaving a parked repaint loses this direct alarm.; keeps the deferred repaint when pending live bytes overflow before the snapshot drains — Pending-live overflow before snapshot drain preserving deferred repaint loses this direct alarm.; keeps the existing repaint behavior for a pending-cap marker — Pending-cap marker preserving deferred repaint behavior loses this direct alarm.