crolled back and resumes when following output — Scrolled-back recovery parking until follow-output resumes loses this direct example.; clears the captured pen for a normal-buffer fallback reattach — Fallback normal-buffer reattach clearing captured pen and dirty background loses this direct example.; waits for a recovered destination fit before forwarding its grid or live output — Recovered destination fitting before forwarding grid or live output loses this direct example.; suppresses the deferred reattach grid push when mobile claims the PTY while hidden — Mobile takeover while hidden suppressing deferred reattach grid forwarding loses this direct example.; drops stale callbacks but delivers fresh replacement output after an old replay clear — Fresh replacement output winning over stale callbacks after old replay clear loses this direct example.; clears the mobile-fit pane binding when the pane connection is disposed — Pane dispose clearing the mobile-fit binding and PTY dataset loses this direct example.; continues post-spawn size reconcile after a transient mobile presence lock — Size reconciliation continuing after a transient phone-presence lock loses this direct example.; spawns the delayed primary pane of an issue-command split when its sibling owns the tab PTY fallback — Delayed primary split spawning independently after a sibling acquires tab fallback loses this direct example.; does not reuse a sibling split pane pending spawn after remount — Remounted primary adopting its own pending PTY rather than the sibling spawn loses this direct example.; replays a stable-pane adoption without submitting the resume command — Stable-pane adoption replay preserving replay-before-live ordering and suppressing resume command loses this direct example.; forwards focus and hover reports without claiming a parked mirror (#26469) — Passive focus/hover forwarding without stealing mirror ownership, then intended Ctrl+C/click claiming, loses this direct example.. Surviving p