        "Audit2694 intentional coverage losses (source-only, no replacement): src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/input/pty-connection-command-finished-interrupt-arbitration.spec.ts: 'drops the command-finished status when pending interrupt inference is rejected': Loses the standalone rejected-inference-to-drop alarm; the delayed-write rows remain but are not equivalent to this immediate rejection example. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/input/pty-connection-bell-query-reply-and-stale-input.spec.ts: 'forwards raw onData after a bell as a query reply': Loses raw onData forwarding after the manually raised bell, including its hibernation-counter expectations. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/input/pty-connection-bell-query-reply-and-stale-input.spec.ts: 'blocks onData on a stale codex pane': The real isCodexPaneStale guard executes, and removing it would allow the typed a to reach transport. Intentionally loses this genuine stale-account typing refusal alarm. No retained query-reply test is claimed equivalent. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/emulation/pty-connection-main-side-effect-authority.spec.ts: 'omits byte-parser callbacks from the local transport options': Loses local main-authority callback omission and lifecycle callback presence checks. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/emulation/pty-connection-main-side-effect-authority.spec.ts: 'keeps byte-parser callbacks on remote-runtime transports': Loses remote-runtime parser callback preservation and factory-argument alarm, including this compatibility boundary; no mixed-version execution is covered. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/emulation/pty-connection-main-side-effect-authority.spec.ts: 'consumes pty:sideEffect facts with the live-path policy after spawn': Loses title/bell fact routing and exact 250ms delayed fake notification example. src/renderer/src/components/termina