ask-complete for generic Codex spinner titles after process identity is confirmed': Real coordinator evidence path runs over fake process answers. Loses positive generic-title/confirmed-Codex completion and inspectProcess-argument alarm. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/notifications/pty-connection-task-complete-dispatch.spec.ts: 'normalizes Pi-compatible remote titles to authoritative OMP launch identity': Real owner-compatible normalization runs. Loses Pi-to-OMP title/status normalization, active tab label, OSC observation, and retained launch-identity example; no real remote transport or equivalent replacement. Wrapper cleanup removes only the deleted bell factory import and its registration-only describe block; no additional authored removal credit. Audit2694 source-only review: Remove14 authored/14 expanded cases in the renderer completion wrapper family, including the complete bell/query-reply/stale-input factory, without replacement. Retain29 authored/34 expanded cases with unchanged callback bodies. Three removals are the existing pending2203 overlap and must be adopted/count-reconciled once; eleven are fresh removals. No current-source runtime or gate execution is supplied by this packet; dated evidence retains its original source scope and does not validate the reduced factory bytes. No equivalent replacement, physical provider, mixed-version, mobile, rendered UI, cross-platform, soak or measured-performance result is claimed. The retained directory-level discovery command continues to discover the reduced family; historical wrapper mentions are not fresh import-closure or execution evidence.",
        "Audit2133 current-parent preparation (988 authored removals; independently reviewed2099/2107/2115/2116 decisions; upstream clear-buffer and recovery-image regressions retained): Intentionally retire these low-value alarms without replacement: src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-hidden-replay.test.ts: structural support changed only; no new authored removal credit. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/spawn/unbound-pane-spawn-recovery.test.ts: requests a tab remount for an unbound spawn; leaves recovery to a remote transport that armed its own retry; requests a remount when the transport reports no recovery of its own; settles the spawn as failed before requesting a remount; prefers the restored leaf id when reporting the anomaly; falls back to the pane leaf id when no restored leaf exists. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/output-restore/pty-connection-dropped-output-snapshot-healing.spec.ts: repaints from the main-owned snapshot when main drops pending output at the cap. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/input/pty-connection-deferred-input-forwarding.spec.ts: routes terminal input through deferPtyInput so the host can withhold it; forwards terminal input directly when the host supplies no deferPtyInput. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/emulation/pty-connection-mode2031-raw-subscription.spec.ts: records a mode 2031 subscribe from the raw chunk boundary without answering. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/output/pty-connection-fresh-native-follow-reset.spec.ts: retries a fresh-spawn native follow reset when renderer dimensions return. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/notifications/pty-connection-terminal-bell-attention.spec.ts: forwards onBell to pane attention and notification policy; hands the bell to the attention module with its pane even when pane attention is off. src/renderer