        "Orcad owner layout retires this native test receipt without replacement. Original receipt verbatim:\n{\n          \"date\": \"2026-09-07\",\n          \"runner\": \"local\",\n          \"platform\": \"macos\",\n          \"command\": \"pnpm test src/main/daemon/pty-subprocess-io-failure-native.test.ts\",\n          \"result\": \"passed\",\n          \"durationSeconds\": 2.52,\n          \"summary\": \"Four native cases pass across 16 real shells, including input/output, pause before teardown, confirmed PID absence, and closed PTY master fds.\",\n          \"currentCommand\": \"pnpm test src/main/daemon/pty-subprocess/testing/pty-subprocess-io-failure-native.test.ts\"\n        }"
