        "evidence": "Historical account for the pre-audit test set; removed work-count alarms and changed selectors have no fresh measurement. Ordinary writes remain byte-identical and create no feature sidecar. Reads add one bounded feature-file existence check; sorted feature comparisons avoid unchanged rewrites, and durable companion writes occur only when compatibility metadata changes. Cleanup adds one constant-size in-flight controller per active destroy and no automatic deadline; the visible settings section polls once per second only while cleanup is active. Provisioning adds one source-host Git ref-resolution command only when a ref was requested and runs it before provider create; adoption adds no remote subprocess beyond its existing checkout probes, and resume adds only in-memory comparisons."
