        "Audit2003 historical original assertionRefs object, preserved verbatim; retired objects are not active execution evidence or replacement coverage:\n{\n          \"file\": \"mobile/src/transport/mobile-relay-reconnect-controller.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"keeps one retry timer when recovery changes from capacity to host offline\",\n            \"drops a pending relay retry after direct connectivity wins\",\n            \"latches pairing-rejected only after the transient-rejection budget is spent\",\n            \"keeps the pairing-rejected latch across a gate lift and app resume\",\n            \"never latches pairing-rejected while an authenticated relay is still live\",\n            \"clears the pairing-rejected latch once the desktop authenticates the device\",\n            \"clears the pairing-rejected latch when direct connectivity proves the pairing\",\n            \"reprobes slowly after rejected E2EE authentication instead of parking forever\",\n            \"keeps the fresh-credential gate reprobing after each failed gated attempt\",\n            \"resets the gated cadence when the app returns to the foreground\",\n            \"mints the gate pass when arming a no-bundle reprobe under a held gate\",\n            \"does not arm a gate reprobe timer when the supervisor declined retries\",\n            \"does not let an orphaned reprobe timer swallow the next fast backoff\",\n            \"lifts the fresh-credential gate when a durable bundle carries a new version\",\n            \"does not reset backoff merely because a failed attempt took one ceiling\",\n            \"resets backoff after an authenticated relay remains stable\",\n            \"paces the next dial by the director Retry-After instead of the local backoff\",\n            \"nudges a retained relay tolerantly when availability returns\",\n            \"redials an attach timeout once quickly per failure streak\"\n          ]\n        }",
        "Audit2003 historical original assertionRefs object, preserved verbatim; retired objects are not active execution evidence or replacement coverage:\n{\n          \"file\": \"mobile/src/transport/mobile-endpoint-supervisor-nudge.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"a replacement Relay that authenticates after backgrounding withdraws without replacing the retained session\"\n          ]\n        }",
