er, p95, rendered E2E or cross-platform validation. Audit1360: focused Linux unit selections validated on source head 415c9cffc2d10024131ec4b6721767a22195de6d. Historical statements above retain their original scope. Intentional test losses are recorded in knownGaps; these runs claim no physical-provider, p95, rendered E2E or cross-platform validation.",
      "motivatingLinks": [
        "https://linear.app/stably/issue/STA-4153/mobile-app-disconnects-frequently"
      ],
      "invariant": "A provider-wanted host without a logical client retries every current-generation pre-client failure until success or explicit cancellation, while release, disconnect, forget, refresh, and stale async continuations preserve their distinct resurrection policies. Direct sessions probe after authenticated silence and terminate after three fair misses. Relay sessions probe after 15s of authenticated silence, retry at once after a fair miss, probe on demand only decisively while a caller's reply is overdue after 4s of authenticated silence, use rate-limited foreground probes, and terminate after two fair misses; a tolerant miss does not count while authenticated frames arrived during the probe window, or while a sent request still awaits its reply and the link has been silent for less than the request timeout. Authenticated traffic, scheduler stalls, and replacement identities cannot manufacture death. Relay recovery must notify presentation independently of transport-state changes, must not inherit a failed direct path's Tailscale hint, and must retain long-outage escalation.",
      "oracle": "Audit2003: Remove held-subscription and viewport replay, background suspension, delivery-ambiguity/error propagation, dial-phase/recovery-path projections, relay timing and authentication-failure examples from the logical client. Retain only make-before-break cutover with subscription replay, committed-response/close arbitration and late-event cancellation fencing against fake physical sessions. Retire all dated combined receipts whole; their case counts and sibling results do not validate these changed bytes. Archive all prospective selector/file/assertion and covered-scope fields with the downgraded gate; the three retained logical callbacks are described here only, without active gate authority. Downgrade active protection to none because no independent unchanged receipt survives. Changed-source prior results do not validate reduced-source bytes. No fresh execution, equivalent replacement, red/green, measured budget, soak, physical provider/PTY, rendered, live remote/mobile or cross-platform result is claimed. Historical prior account (preserved verbatim): Inject rejected and never-settling catalog reads, missing profiles, synchronous construction failure, release, refresh, forget, revival, and stale completion under fake time. Require bounded 1s through 60s retry, exact current-generation publication, and no zero-owner or forgotten-client resurrection. Inject direct and relay authenticated text/binary traffic, silent probe windows, stalled clocks, replacement identities, and failed writes. Require direct three-miss tolerance; Relay idle probes only after 15s without authenticated frames, no demand-driven liveness traffic, one foreground probe sequence, two fair 4s misses, a 10s voluntary rate limit, no old-session network-change probe, and delivery-unknown mutations without replay. Start and clear Relay recovery without changing transport state and require observers to rerender. Project five failed Tailscale attempts into a neutral Relay-specific verdict, then require twelve attempts to produce a Relay-specific unreachable verdict with no Tailscale hint. Upstream oracle specification after Relay correction (not execution evidence): Inject rejected and never-settling catalog reads, missing profiles, synchronous construction failure, release, refresh, forget, revival, and stale completion under fake time. Require bounded 1s through 60s retry, exact current-generation publication, and no zero-owner or forgotten-client resurrection. Inject direct and relay authenticated text/binary traffic, silent probe windows, stalled clocks, replacement identities, and failed writes. Require direct three-miss tolerance; Relay idle probes only after 15s without authenticated frames, one foreground probe sequence, two fair 4s misses, a 10s voluntary rate limit, no old-session network-change probe, and delivery-unknown mutations without replay. Start and clear Relay recovery without changing transport state and require observers to rerender. Project five failed Tailscale attempts into a neutral Relay-specific verdict, then require twelve attempts to produce a Relay-specific unreachable verdict with no Tailscale hint.",
