        "Audit2141: Remove only the in-memory fake-store restart callback from src/main/runtime/client/navigation/multi-client-navigation-isolation.integration.test.ts. Its copied persistence-object alarm is intentionally lost without replacement. All eight actual paired-WebSocket callbacks and five active assertion aliases remain byte-identical. Existing Electron receipt is unchanged and validates only its original source/journey; no fresh validation of the reduced integration selector, disk persistence, live remote/mobile, or cross-platform result is claimed.",
        "No live Windows or Linux server run yet; the reported field topology was a Windows 11 server.",
