d. Loses actual mobile split sibling shell versus recorded-agent resume command alarms; no equivalent coverage asserted. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-native-chat-setup.spec.ts removed. Loses separate setup/startup tab result in that manually assembled path. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime.test.ts reduced. Driver registration/import of a whole-deleted selected spec is removed; directly authored cases remain unchanged. No extra authored removal credit. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. Existing exact unaffected receipts remain unchanged and apply only to their unchanged selectors. Changed optional selectors have no new execution result.\nWindow folder cleanup retires the mock-call-only navigation fence suite and the per-generation warning-count case. Retained sender results and existing rendered checks keep their own original scope; no equivalent replacement or fresh execution is claimed here.",
      "motivatingLinks": [
