        "Audit3597 scope: remove two renderer-hang-capture examples (2 authored/2 finite): an invalid repeated-token oversized reducer fixture and a shorter unanswered-request fixture. Intentionally lose the direct truncated flag/sanitized frame fixture and request-pending status/zero-sample alarms. Retain window-death/stale-result exclusion, generation reconciliation, and baseline-publication cancellation lifecycles; they are not equivalent bound, redaction or pending-status replacements. Historical execution retains its original source scope; no new runtime evidence is claimed.",
