        "Audit3606 adopts the enhanced3604/3605 icon cuts: nine authored/nine finite cases removed, including the whole tray-attention-icon suite. Retires the no-encoder oversized-upload null sample, missing-ID/request-order sample, encoder-null PNG-prefix fallback, SVG/404 rejection samples, transparent amber-dot placement and half-alpha white-tint sample, exact small fetched-byte passthrough, host-qualified image-key inventory and constant-encoder large-upload projection. These specific admission, formatting and bitmap alarms are intentionally lost without equivalent replacements. Retained queue/cache, bounded fetch and Dock lifecycle checks do not establish actual raster decoding, native image conversion or rendered appearance. Historical receipts below are preserved evidence for earlier test sets, not fresh validation of this reduced selection.",
