        "Audit3628: remove the entire one-authored/one-finite RepositoryRemoveProjectSection happy-dom suite. Accept losing the local zero-to-one-terminal stale-count revalidation alarm: first confirmation defers the removal callback and second confirmation invokes it after the count snapshot updates. The test never asserts updated warning text/count, actual terminal creation or removal/PTY teardown, host/scope routing, cancellation or folder/mobile behavior. No equivalent replacement or end-to-end warning-before-teardown proof asserted. Static evidence only; historical receipts retain original scope.",
