ns corrected footer rows and publishes new cursor entries.\nsrc/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-11.spec.ts :: does not let stale lower rows hide earlier corrected footer rows from cursor reads :: Earlier corrected footer row must not be hidden by stale lower rows in cursor reads.\nsrc/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-11.spec.ts :: bounds completed transcript entries from a single multi-line redraw chunk :: Single redraw chunk bounds completed transcript to2000retained lines and correct oldest/next/latest cursors.\nsrc/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-11.spec.ts :: retains multi-line ANSI redraws when the last footer row stays partial :: Partial final redrawn row appears in preview but cursor sees it only after newline.\nsrc/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-11.spec.ts :: does not retain split ANSI controls as visible terminal preview text :: Split color/mode escapes never leak preview fragments; long split OSC title truncates at MAX_OSC_TITLE_CHARS.\nsrc/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-11.spec.ts :: retains same-line redraw cursor position across split full-line erase chunks :: Full-line erase preserves column across chunks so XY follows three spaces rather than old ABC.\nsrc/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/conpty-stream-read.spec.ts :: fills the requested line count even when blank rows sit below the prompt :: Blank rows below a ConPTY prompt must not consume the requested nonempty-line count.\nsrc/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-12.spec.ts :: does not retain split ST-terminated string controls as preview text :: Split ST-terminated Kitty/string controls must remain excluded from preview text.\nsrc/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-output-and-worker-recovery.spec.ts :: detects split OSC titles before retaining terminal previews :: Split BEL OSC