        "Audit1983: Delete the mocked browser placement mutation and projection suites and both prospective selectors. Preserve3 unrelated receipts. Changed-source prior results do not validate reduced-source bytes. No fresh execution, equivalent replacement, red/green, measured budget, soak, provider/PTY, rendered, live remote/mobile or cross-platform result is claimed.",
        "Audit1983 historical original commands object, preserved verbatim; retired objects are not active execution evidence or replacement coverage:\n\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/browser/routing/guest-authority/browser-route-webcontents-registry.test.ts src/main/browser/client-hosts/lifecycle/paired-runtime-browser-client-host-reconnect.test.ts src/main/browser/client-hosts/lifecycle/paired-runtime-browser-client-host-composition.test.ts src/main/runtime/browser/client-pages/runtime-browser-client-page-recovery.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/session-tabs/session-tab-browser-placement-mutations.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/session-tabs/session-tab-browser-placement-projection.test.ts\"",
        "Audit1983 historical original testFiles object, preserved verbatim; retired objects are not active execution evidence or replacement coverage:\n\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/session-tabs/session-tab-browser-placement-mutations.test.ts\"",
        "Audit1983 historical original testFiles object, preserved verbatim; retired objects are not active execution evidence or replacement coverage:\n\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/session-tabs/session-tab-browser-placement-projection.test.ts\"",
        "Audit1991: Remove the ordinary browser-host release/sub-cap and exact socket-close counter aliases. Retain the two actual admitted-device fairness and shared ask/browser/wait budget callbacks, which call server handlers with fake WebSockets and controlled pending RPCs. Preserve all3 unrelated dated receipts. No real browser placement or remote tunnel deployment is proved by this admission suite. Changed-source prior results do not validate reduced-source bytes. No fresh execution, equivalent replacement, red/green, measured budget, soak, physical provider/PTY, rendered, live remote/mobile or cross-platform result is claimed.",
        "Audit1991 historical original assertionRefs object, preserved verbatim; retired objects are not active execution evidence or replacement coverage:\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/main/runtime/rpc/server/runtime-rpc-browser-host-admission.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"browser-host attachment has a dedicated sub-cap that preserves ordinary wait admission\",\n            \"one paired device cannot consume the second device's reserved browser-host share\",\n            \"asks and browser hosts share a ceiling that retains one quarter of total capacity for waits\",\n            \"socket close aborts the exact host and wait handlers and releases both counters\"\n          ]\n        }",
        "Module layout SSH policy: Retire the dynamic-forward launch argument/default inventory. The retained actual startup-cancellation entry case covers cancellation classification and termination/probe cleanup requests with supplied process/socket boundaries, not real SSH launch flags or live forwarding. Remove only the retired launch-flags assertion; unrelated dated receipts and their executed commands remain unchanged.",
        "Historical dynamic-forward assertion metadata before inventory retirement, preserved verbatim:\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/main/ssh/system-transport/forwarding/system-ssh-dynamic-forward-process.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"system SSH uses BatchMode=yes, disables ControlMaster, and positions one dynamic forward before the destination\",\n            \"authority invalidation cancels an in-progress SSH launch and destroys its active readiness probe immediately\"\n          ]\n        }",
        "Audit3381 intentionally removes the entire browser network tunnel protocol suite and active selectors/assertion. Static envelope/dispatch protocol alarms are lost without equivalent replacement. Remaining tunnel session and stream tests have narrower scopes. All three unrelated complete dated receipts are preserved verbatim with their original selectors; no fresh execution claimed.\nOriginal active selector fields, historical raw native JSON values:\ncommands: [\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/browser/routing/guest-authority/browser-route-webcontents-registry.test.ts src/main/browser/client-hosts/lifecycle/paired-runtime-browser-client-host-reconnect.test.ts src/main/browser/client-hosts/lifecycle/paired-runtime-browser-client-host-composition.test.ts src/main/runtime/browser/client-pages/runtime-browser-client-page-recovery.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/browser-host/reconciliation/browser-host-page-retirement.test.ts src/main/runtime/browser-host/reconciliation/browser-host-page-placement-replacement.test.ts src/main/runtime/browser-host/reconciliation/browser-host-page-placement.test.ts src/main/runtime/browser-host/leases/browser-host-lease-registry.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/browser-host/commands/browser-host-command-ledger.test.ts src/main/runtime/browser-host/reconciliation/browser-host-page-placement.test.ts src/main/runtime/browser-host/leases/browser-host-lease-registry.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/browser/browser-client-host-reconciliation.test.ts src/main/runtime/browser-host/leases/browser-host-lease-registry.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/browser/client-pages/execution/browser-client-page-command-executor.test.ts src/main/browser/client-pages/execution/browser-client-page-command-integration.test.ts src/main/browser/client-pages/lifecycle/browser-client-page-inventory.test.ts src/main/browser/client-hosts/lifecycle/paired-runtime-browser-client-host-composition.test.ts src/main/browser/client-hosts/leases/paired-runtime-browser-host-lease.test.ts src/main/runtime/browser-host/leases/browser-host-lease-registry.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/browser/browser-client-host.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/browser/client-pages/lifecycle/browser-client-page-reconciliation-adapters.test.ts src/main/browser/routing/sessions/browser-route-prepared-page-rekey.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/shared/browser/network/tunnels/browser-network-tunnel-protocol.test.ts src/main/browser/network/tunnels/browser-network-tunnel-session.test.ts src/main/browser/network/tunnels/remote-browser-socks-server.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/browser/network/tunnels/browser-network-tunnel-client.test.ts src/main/browser/network/execution-routes/paired-runtime-browser-network-route.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/browser/browser-network-tunnel.test.ts src/main/runtime/browser/network/browser-network-tunnel-paired-runtime.integration.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/browser/network/tunnels/browser-network-tunnel-outbound-memory-budget.test.ts src/main/browser/network/tunnels/browser-network-tunnel-session-aggregate-memory.test.ts src/shared/ws-outbound-backpressure-queue.test.ts src/shared/remote-runtime/remote-runtime-client.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/shared/ws-outbound-backpressure-queue.test.ts src/shared/remote-runtime/remote-runtime-client.test.ts src/main/runtime/browser-host/leases/browser-host-lease-registry.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/server/runtime-rpc-browser-host-adm