        "Audit1396 retires this complete dated receipt because a source in its selector was deleted or reduced. It does not validate the reduced selector. Original receipt verbatim:\n{\n          \"date\": \"2026-08-16\",\n          \"runner\": \"local\",\n          \"platform\": \"macos\",\n          \"command\": \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/browser/browser-route-webcontents-registry.test.ts src/main/browser/browser-route-webrtc-egress.electron.test.ts\",\n          \"currentCommand\": \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/browser/routing/guest-authority/browser-route-webcontents-registry.test.ts src/main/browser/network/egress/browser-route-webrtc-egress.electron.test.ts\",\n          \"result\": \"passed\",\n          \"durationSeconds\": 8,\n          \"summary\": \"Two files passed 24 assertions; the real Electron control emitted direct STUN, while the exact per-guest policy emitted zero desktop UDP packets and policy failure remained quarantined through delayed or failed close.\"\n        }",
