        "Audit3390 composes root-adopted3382/independent3383 and3386/independent3387 and3388/independent3389: intentionally retires216 authored registrations/230 expanded cases in42 whole authored suites plus5 zero-case registration drivers, without equivalent replacement. Lost local alarms include fake PTY identity/routing/startup/replay/mode/title/mouse/IME/scroll matrices, broad startup identity and file-open wiring, mock mailbox title recovery, mobile row parity and whole-v-selective save parity. Retained24 registrations/26 expanded cases in22 suites preserve actual xterm Windows buffer/wrap/scroll, typed TOML scalar, real Promise cancellation/settlement, HTTP Codex scanner/projector semantics, durable recovery admission/newer-schema bytes, federation completion/ACK/SQLite atomicity and failed stale-run-write versus imported durable history. Additional retained clock-domain scheduling, durable freeze/ACK/checkpoint ordering, ABA dirty intent, SQL atomicity, folder-domain retier/last-note deletion, scrollback durable no-sync staging, PanelBridge subscriber lifetime and reserved-send publication preserve narrower concrete behaviors. Current finite owner drift assessed in bounded defining bodies; retained callback bytes unchanged. Historical notes and complete dated receipts keep their original exact scopes. No new execution, equivalent replacement, native focus/device/pixel, live remote or global mixed-version guarantee is claimed.\nOriginal active selector fields (historical raw native JSON values; not current coverage):\ncommands: [\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/daemon/shell-readiness/testing/terminal-shell-recovery-barrier.test.ts src/main/daemon/sessions/testing/session-shell-recovery.test.ts src/main/daemon/sessions/testing/session.test.ts src/main/daemon/terminal-host/testing/terminal-host-concurrent-create.test.ts src/main/daemon/providers/adapter/testing/daemon-pty-adapter.test.ts src/main/daemon/history/restoration/testing/daemon-restore-scrollback-depth.test.ts src/main/daemon/history/restoration/testing/terminal-checkpoint-serializer.test.ts src/main/providers/agent-foreground-process.test.ts src/main/runtime/construction/orca-runtime.test.ts src/main/runtime/terminal/layout/mobile-presence-lock.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-visibility-and-exit.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-input-and-repaint.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-hidden-replay.test.ts src/shared/terminal/protocol/escape/terminal-partial-escape-tail.test.ts src/shared/terminal/protocol/escape/terminal-partial-escape-tail.fuzz.test.ts --reporter=dot\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts tests/e2e/cross-version-wire/cross-version-terminal-wire.unit.test.ts --reporter=dot\",\n        \"pnpm exec electron-vite build --mode e2e\",\n        \"SKIP_BUILD=1 pnpm exec playwright test tests/e2e/terminal-hidden-child-tui-kill-mode-reset.spec.ts --config tests/playwright.config.ts --project electron-headless --workers=1\"\n      ]\ntestFiles: [\n        \"src/main/daemon/shell-readiness/testing/terminal-shell-recovery-barrier.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/daemon/sessions/testing/session-shell-recovery.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/daemon/sessions/testing/session.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/daemon/terminal-host/testing/terminal-host-concurrent-create.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/daemon/providers/adapter/testing/daemon-pty-adapter.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/daemon/history/restoration/testing/daemon-restore-scrollback-depth.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/daemon/history/restoration/testing/terminal-checkpoint-serializer.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/providers/agent-foreground-process.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/runtime/construction/orca-runtime.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/runtime/terminal/layout/mobile-presence-lock.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-visibility-and-exit.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-input-and-repaint.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-hidden-replay.test.ts\",\n        \"src/shared/terminal/protocol/escape/terminal-partial-escape-tail.test.ts\",\n        \"src/shared/terminal/protocol/escape/terminal-partial-escape-tail.fuzz.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/e2e/cross-version-wire/cross-version-terminal-wire.unit.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/e2e/terminal-hidden-child-tui-kill-mode-reset.spec.ts\"\n      ]\nassertionRefs: [\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/main/daemon/sessions/testing/session-shell-recovery.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"post-kill shell output survives into the normalized snapshot instead of the discarded alt buffer\",\n            \"a snapshot taken during a split escape keeps the pending tail intact and stale proof is revoked by the completing bytes\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/shared/terminal/protocol/escape/terminal-partial-escape-tail.fuzz.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"the pending tail this gate threads over the wire folds identically at every code-unit split of the combined stream, including boundaries landing inside oscEsc/stringEsc\",\n            \"the split sweep runs over an alphabet carrying CAN, SUB, doubled ESC inside OSC/DCS/SOS/PM/APC, BEL, C1 ST, NUL, DEL, intermediates, CJK, astral, and lone surrogates\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"tests/e2e/terminal-hidden-child-tui-kill-mode-reset.spec.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"normal exit and cleanup-free SIGKILL both restore a visible clean shell marker\",\n            \"renderer logical buffer is normal and mouse tracking is disabled after host-proven recovery