nd-agent-status-part-03.spec.ts: does not use stale runtime-created PTY status when a neutral PTY title exists; recognizes runtime-created Codex PTY handles from the ready prompt; recognizes runtime-created Antigravity PTY handles from the ready prompt; recognizes live leaf Antigravity terminals from the ready prompt; recognizes a later Antigravity header with a prompt but no model line; keeps mobile terminal surfaces visible while their leaf handle is pending. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-handles-and-agent-status-part-02.spec.ts: lets Claude agents management titles clear stale runtime-created title status; does not recognize live Claude agents panes from a Claude foreground process; does not let stale tab-level agent titles override current neutral pane titles; lists live terminals with fresh pane titles over stale tab titles; lets adopted neutral pane titles use non-shell foreground fallback; lets adopted neutral pane titles retry wrapper foregrounds until recognized; authorizes settled CLI prompts only after positive %s foreground identity; does not recognize arbitrary foreground TUIs as running agents; lets live neutral pane titles retry wrapper foregrounds until recognized; lets current Claude agents PTY titles override stale runtime-created OSC titles; does not let stale Claude agents OSC titles suppress current PTY title activity. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-handles-and-agent-status.spec.ts: keeps preallocated terminal handles valid across renderer reloads; preserves runtime-created PTY process identity after graph unavailable; keeps prompt bindings fenced across runtime restarts without provider incarnation; recognizes runtime-created PTY handles with agent launch titles; does not treat a bare Cursor Agent native title as a running agent session; uses stale runtime-created PTY status when there is no title or foreground evidence. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-output-and-worker-recovery-part-07.spec.ts: keeps o