        "Audit1401: src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-duplicate-pty-repair.spec.ts removed. Loses listing-on-already-repaired-data alarm; it never established runtime repair invocation. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-split-agent-tab.spec.ts removed. Loses actual mobile split sibling shell versus recorded-agent resume command alarms; no equivalent coverage asserted. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-native-chat-setup.spec.ts removed. Loses separate setup/startup tab result in that manually assembled path. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime.test.ts reduced. Driver registration/import of a whole-deleted selected spec is removed; directly authored cases remain unchanged. No extra authored removal credit. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. Historical removed assertion inventory: [{\"file\":\"src/main/runtime/orca-runtime.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"live, unknown, stale, missing-intent, non-owner, and inventory-proven but not yet pane-bound lifecycle closes invoke neither PTY kill nor renderer close\",\"dead whole-headless retirement removes stale state without signalling a retained PTY id\"]}]",
        "Audit1939 (sources1934/1935): Retain actual parked exit/disposal/cancel/leaf progression using injected exit and close adapters. The retained last-watcher case checks exact lifecyclePtyId, but no retained callback establishes the whole existing replacement-or-sibling-incarnation alias. Retire that broad assertion object rather than transfer partial support. Capability admission, static fields and duplicate routing examples are intentionally lost; unchanged daemon E2E receipts remain scoped to their own commands. Preserve meaningful remaining selectors/assertions and unchanged dated receipts within their original scope. Reduced selectors have no fresh gate execution evidence in this metadata packet. No equivalent replacement, physical watcher/PTY/provider, live SSH/remote/mobile, rendered, cross-platform, soak or measured-budget result is claimed. Exact retired authored alarms: 'never starts a watcher for a PTY that exited into the park handoff gap'; 'collapses the exited leaf out of the stored layout when deferring'; 'retires launch/title hints when the launch-owning parked leaf exits'; 'keeps launch ownership when only a parked shell sibling exits'; 'rejects ordinary parking for a preserved daemon with a lossy snapshot'; 'rejects a capture containing a PTY without snapshot backing'; 'accepts layout-derived candidates when the capture is stale'; 'rejects layout-derived candidates missing a leaf PTY binding'.",
