      "coverageNotes": "Audit3077 retires the sole active passed IPC receipt; no current execution evidence remains for this gate. Historical account (not current coverage): Audit2133 current-parent preparation: Current reduced sources/selectors intentionally retire the alarms listed in knownGaps; prior dated runs and replacement claims do not validate the changed set. Historical prior account (preserved verbatim): Audit1760 removes the standalone startup-cwd policy suite without equivalent replacement. One fresh Linux run passed21 retained IPC transport unit cases; cwd-specific coverage returns mocked fallback metadata only. Original receipts and scope are archived in knownGaps; current platform scope reflects this unit run, not a native provider. Historical coverage account (not current evidence): Audit1683 removes low-value test projections, mock wiring, private-state assertions, inventories and duplicate examples without equivalent replacement coverage. Per-source reviews record retained public behavior and refusal boundaries with injected/native/remote limits. Affected historical receipts are retired; gates without active current evidence are downgraded. Historical scope before this audit: Audit1640 removes low-value IPC, SSH, workspace and transcript-watcher tests without equivalent replacement coverage. Per-source reviews record retained public refusal, cancellation, execution-host and real-filesystem outcomes with injected/native/remote limits. Affected historical receipts are retired; gates without active current evidence are downgraded. Historical scope before this audit: Audit1396 changes referenced sources. Retained unchanged-source receipts apply only to their unchanged commands; the reduced selectors have no new execution result. Historical coverage account (not a current claim for changed sources): Local macOS evidence covers the shared missing-dir fallback policy, main pty:spawn recovery and metadata, no-flag and reattach strictness, renderer IPC flag routing, SSH-tagged and remote-runtime omission, and the visibility-gated terminal notice. Real Bash and Zsh node-pty tests replace the active cwd inode and exercise the shared POSIX OMP wrapper; audit829 removes generated-file snapshots and their current byte-parity claim. No equivalent replacement for generated-script byte checks is claimed. Daemon shares the same pre-provider main cwd decision but lacks a live daemon-provider run; WSL UNC paths are exempt from the spawn probe and lack a live run; native PowerShell is unaffected; Linux/Windows and mobile/API strictness remain gaps. Audit1396: src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection-pending-spawn.spec.ts reduced. Lose standalone debug-state retention/log silence alarm. React StrictMode is not mounted; bindings manually simulate remount over mocked transport. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed.",
