        "NEXT65 active selector scope reduction (including directory-selected whole-file retirements): src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-spawn-and-startup.test.ts. Remove complete registrations or registrar files within the selected scope for src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/spawn/pty-connection-split-spawn.spec.ts. Intentionally lose these named regression alarms without replacement: clears the mobile-fit pane binding when the pane connection is disposed — Pane dispose clearing the mobile-fit binding and PTY dataset loses this direct example.; continues post-spawn size reconcile after a transient mobile presence lock — Size reconciliation continuing after a transient phone-presence lock loses this direct example.; spawns the delayed primary pane of an issue-command split when its sibling owns the tab PTY fallback — Delayed primary split spawning independently after a sibling acquires tab fallback loses this direct example.; does not reuse a sibling split pane pending spawn after remount — Remounted primary adopting its own pending PTY rather than the sibling spawn loses this direct example.; replays a stable-pane adoption without submitting the resume command — Stable-pane adoption replay preserving replay-before-live ordering and suppressing resume command loses this direct example.; forwards focus and hover reports without claiming a parked mirror (#26469) — Passive focus/hover forwarding without stealing mirror ownership, then intended Ctrl+C/click claiming, loses this direct example.. Surviving parent statements and sibling registrations are preserved, but these reduced parent selectors have no fresh execution or transferred historical pass. Unrelated complete dated receipts retain only their original exact scopes; no equivalent replacement, rendered UI, provider, mobile, or cross-platform coverage is claimed.",
        "NEXT65 historical original active parent-selector fields (verbatim native JSON values; not current coverage):\ncommands: [\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/hooks/useDetectedAgents.test.tsx src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/detected-agents.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/local-detected-agent-state.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-group-create-race.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-groups-delete.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-groups-owner-routing.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/projects/repos-project-host-capability.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/projects/repos-project-host-lifecycle.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-remove-project-purge-leak.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-update-serialization.test.ts src/renderer/src/lib/agent-session/launch/new-tab/launch-agent-in-new-tab.test.ts --reporter=verbose\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-spawn-and-startup.test.ts --reporter=dot\",\n        \"Headed Electron/CDP STA-4027 journey on Orca environment windows 2 with a selected Ubuntu-24.04 WSL project and local Floating Workspace\"\n      ]\ntestFiles: [\n        \"src/renderer/src/hooks/useDetectedAgents.test.tsx\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/detected-agents.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/local-detected-agent-state.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-group-create-race.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-groups-delete.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-groups-owner-routing.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/projects/repos-project-host-capability.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/projects/repos-project-host-lifecycle.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-remove-project-purge-leak.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-update-serialization.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/lib/agent-session/launch/new-tab/launch-agent-in-new-tab.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-spawn-and-startup.test.ts\"\n      ]\nassertionRefs: [\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/hooks/useDetectedAgents.test.tsx\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"the active WSL project advertises only its WSL agent while Floating advertises only the native-host agent\",\n            \"Floating refresh preserves both scoped inventories and does not overwrite the legacy active-project inventory\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/local-detected-agent-state.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"same-context callers deduplicate without cached broadcast fanout\",\n            \"refresh supersedes stale detection and failed cold refresh remains retryable\",\n            \"project removal evicts in-flight context state\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-remove-project-purge-leak.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"removing one project evicts its authority-scoped agent inventory without disturbing another project\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/lib/agent-session/launch/new-tab/launch-agent-in-new-tab.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"the advertised Floating agent launches in a Floating tab with null runtime ownership and no paired-runtime create call\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]",
        "Audit3069 retires nominal spawn/resume/banner wiring, first-fit and lookup-budget variants, private pending-map checks, the split-CWD disposal suite and startup command/draft baseline variants. Distinct regression alarms are intentionally lost without equivalent replacement; retained ownership, cancellation and recovery cases remain. Existing selectors and dated evidence retain their original scope. The retired Floating local IPC/WSL routing alias is removed; the separate StrictMode pending-spawn adoption alias remains.",
        "Audit3061 retires the park-model supplied snapshot suite and nominal mode, cursor, focus, geometry and remote resume metadata variants. Their distinct alarms are intentionally lost; six retained mode/remote cases preserve selected tail-order, authority and parse-readiness boundaries without equivalent replacement. Existing selectors and dated evidence retain their original scope.",
        "Audit2133 current-parent preparation (988 authored removals; independently reviewed2099/2107/2115/2116 decisions; upstream clear-buffer and recovery-image regressions retained): Intentionally retire these low-value alarms without replacement: src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-spawn-and-startup.test.ts: remove only literal registration import/call pairs import { registerPtyConnectionTerminalBellAttentionTests } from '../notifications/pty-connection-terminal-bell-attention.spec', registerPtyConnectionTerminalBellAttentionTests(); no additional authored credit. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/notifications/pty-connection-terminal-bell-attention.spec.ts: forwards onBell to pane attention and notification policy; hands the bell to the attention module with its pane even when pane attention is off. Current changed source bytes, wrapper registrations and reduced selectors have no fresh execution or red/green credit. Unrelated surviving receipt objects keep their original narrow scope; current literal graph reachability does not establish historical import closure or equivalent replacement coverage. Current conservative command/import graph reaches src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-spawn-and-startup.test.ts, src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/notifications/pty-connection-terminal-bell-attention.spec.ts. Unresolved local/computed edges remain explicit debt.",
        "Audit2065 (sources2063/2064): Intentionally retire these low-value alarms without replacement: src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-spawn-and-startup.test.ts: ordinary registration cleanup removes only import { registerPtyConnectionStartupCwdFallbackNoticeTests } from '../startup/pty-connection-startup-cwd-fallback-notice.spec'; registerPtyConnectionStartupCwdFallbackNoticeTests(). src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/startup/pty-connection-startup-cwd-fallback-notice.spec.ts: prints a terminal notice when the startup cwd fell back to the workspace root. Existing unrelated evidenceRuns retain their original scope; unchanged dated receipt objects do not validate changed source bytes or reduced selectors. No fresh gate execution or historical import-closure equivalence is claimed. Frozen current literal-import graph reaches these changed test bytes; unresolved local and computed edges remain debt, and current reachability is not historical execution or equivalent replacement evidence.",
        "Live SSH and paired-runtime launch journeys are covered by existing authority contracts rather than this focused oracle.",
        "The test-value audit removes standalone WSL/provider argument inventories and basic supplied-result/cache-clear examples from detected-agents.test.ts. It retains shared in-flight detection, cached-context return, repair/retry, stale-response fencing, SSH refresh/pruning and old-server fallback behavior. These retained tests do not replace the removed route-argument alarms or execute a live WSL/remote probe. Historical commands, counts and results remain unchanged.",
        "The later test-value audit removes narrow refusal/reset ledgers, a settled-project eviction/reacquisition example, a simple stale-success variant and redundant plain-text draft cleanup examples. local-detected-agent-state retains independent inventory completion orders, preference-change fencing, full-refresh loading settlement, refresh failure/retry, native-versus-WSL separation, subscriber broadcast bounds and in-flight project eviction. The removed settled-context sibling-preservation/reacquisition alarm is intentionally lost; retained cases are not equivalent replacements and no live provider execution is claimed. Historical commands, counts and results remain unchanged.",
        "The test-value audit retires the standalone project-runtime registrar from repos-project-mutations.test.ts. Its updateProject runtime-preference example no longer checks clearing detectedAgentIds, isDetectingAgents and isRefreshingAgents or dispatch of orca:installed-agent-skills-changed. This narrow invalidation alarm is lost; no equivalent replacement is claimed. Historical executed commands, counts and results remain unchanged.",
        "Audit1342: src/renderer/src/hooks/useAgentDetectionTarget.test.ts removed. Floating/runtime/hydration/stamped owner key selection, scanning count and malformed decode fallback matrices disappear. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed.",
        "Audit1342 retires this complete dated receipt because a source in its selector was deleted or reduced. It does not validate the reduced selector. Original receipt verbatim:\n{\n          \"date\": \"2026-08-12\",\n          \"runner\": \"local\",\n          \"platform\": \"macos\",\n          \"command\": \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/hooks/useDetectedAgents.test.tsx src/renderer/src/hooks/useAgentDetectionTarget.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/slices/detected-agents.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/slices/local-detected-agent-state.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/slices/repos-remove-project-purge-leak.test.ts src/renderer/src/lib/local-preflight-context.test.ts src/renderer/src/lib/launch-agent-in-new-tab.test.ts --reporter=verbose\",\n          \"result\": \"passed\",\n          \"durationSeconds\": 2,\n          \"summary\": \"Seven focused files passed independent WSL/local inventory, refresh isolation, cache lifecycle, project eviction, and Floating launch-call assertions. Historical command preserved after removal of the selector-only local-preflight suite in the test-value audit; currentCommand names the remaining suites only. This historical result has not been rerun for that command and does not claim equivalent coverage.\",\n          \"currentCommand\": \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/hooks/useDetectedAgents.test.tsx src/renderer/src/hooks/useAgentDetectionTarget.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/slices/detected-agents.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/slices/local-detected-agent-state.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/slices/repos-project-mutations.test.ts src/renderer/src/lib/launch-agent-in-new-tab.test.ts --reporter=verbose\"\n        }",
        "Audit1342 historical platform/provider scope before source changes: {\"coveredPlatforms\":[\"macos\",\"windows\"],\"coveredProviders\":[\"local\",\"wsl\"]}. Remaining provider scope applies only to unchanged-source receipts.",
        "Audit1396: src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection-pending-spawn.spec.ts reduced. Lose standalone debug-state retention/log silence alarm. React StrictMode is not mounted; bindings manually simulate remount over mocked transport. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed.",
        "Audit1396 retires this complete dated receipt because a source in its selector was deleted or reduced. It does not validate the reduced selector. Original receipt verbatim:\n{\n          \"date\": \"2026-08-12\",\n          \"runner\": \"local\",\n          \"platform\": \"macos\",\n          \"command\": \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection-fresh-spawn-guards.test.ts --reporter=dot\",\n          \"result\": \"passed\",\n          \"durationSeconds\": 20,\n          \"summary\": \"The full PTY connection suite passed the independent Floating native-host transport oracle.\",\n          \"currentCommand\": \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection-spawn-and-startup.test.ts --reporter=dot\"\n        }",
        "Audit1396 historical platform/provider scope before source changes: {\"coveredPlatforms\":[\"macos\",\"windows\"],\"coveredProviders\":[\"local\",\"wsl\"]}. Remaining provider scope applies only to unchanged-source receipts.",
        "Audit2371 reduces repos-project-group-create-race.test.ts by removing the two-host generic failed-create-response/no-op example. Its alarm that a failed create reply leaves an intervening refreshed state untouched is intentionally lost. The surviving refreshed-field and original-owner races do not supply equivalent replacement coverage. No fresh execution or red/green evidence validates the reduced source; unrelated physical Windows/WSL receipt retains its original command and scope.",
        "Finite R02 ownership closure retires all three cases from pty-connection/spawn/pty-connection-fresh-spawn-guards.spec.ts and its empty aggregate registration. Intentionally lost alarms: deletion-phase fresh-spawn admission; wrapped worktree-removal fence error suppression; classified typing versus synthetic query/mouse/alternate-wheel replay input, normal-arrow preservation, deferred input provenance and post-replay restoration. No equivalent replacement coverage, new execution, real PTY delivery or CI claim. Historical receipts and their original commands/counts/results remain historical and do not validate the reduced selector.",
        "Audit3390 composes root-adopted3382/independent3383 and3386/independent3387 and3388/independent3389: intentionally retires216 authored registrations/230 expanded cases in42 whole authored suites plus5 zero-case registration drivers, without equivalent replacement. Lost local alarms include fake PTY identity/routing/startup/replay/mode/title/mouse/IME/scroll matrices, broad startup identity and file-open wiring, mock mailbox title recovery, mobile row parity and whole-v-selective save parity. Retained24 registrations/26 expanded cases in22 suites preserve actual xterm Windows buffer/wrap/scroll, typed TOML scalar, real Promise cancellation/settlement, HTTP Codex scanner/projector semantics, durable recovery admission/newer-schema bytes, federation completion/ACK/SQLite atomicity and failed stale-run-write versus imported durable history. Additional retained clock-domain scheduling, durable freeze/ACK/checkpoint ordering, ABA dirty intent, SQL atomicity, folder-domain retier/last-note deletion, scrollback durable no-sync staging, PanelBridge subscriber lifetime and reserved-send publication preserve narrower concrete behaviors. Current finite owner drift assessed in bounded defining bodies; retained callback bytes unchanged. Historical notes and complete dated receipts keep their original exact scopes. No new execution, equivalent replacement, native focus/device/pixel, live remote or global mixed-version guarantee is claimed.\nOriginal active selector fields (historical raw native JSON values; not current coverage):\ncommands: [\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/hooks/useDetectedAgents.test.tsx src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/detected-agents.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/local-detected-agent-state.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-group-create-race.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-groups-delete.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-groups-owner-routing.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/projects/repos-project-host-capability.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/projects/repos-project-host-lifecycle.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-remove-project-purge-leak.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-update-serialization.test.ts src/renderer/src/lib/agent-session/launch/new-tab/launch-agent-in-new-tab.test.ts --reporter=verbose\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-spawn-and-startup.test.ts --reporter=dot\",\n        \"Headed Electron/CDP STA-4027 journey on Orca environment windows 2 with a selected Ubuntu-24.04 WSL project and local Floating Workspace\"\n      ]\ntestFiles: [\n        \"src/renderer/src/hooks/useDetectedAgents.test.tsx\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/detected-agents.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/local-detected-agent-state.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-group-create-race.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-groups-delete.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-groups-owner-routing.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/projects/repos-project-host-capability.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/projects/repos-project-host-lifecycle.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-remove-project-purge-leak.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-update-serialization.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/lib/agent-session/launch/new-tab/launch-agent-in-new-tab.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/tests/pty-connection-spawn-and-startup.test.ts\"\n      ]\nassertionRefs: [\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/hooks/useDetectedAgents.test.tsx\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"the active WSL project advertises only its WSL agent while Floating advertises only the native-host agent\",\n            \"Floating refresh preserves both scoped inventories and does not overwrite the legacy active-project inventory\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/local-detected-agent-state.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"same-context callers deduplicate without cached broadcast fanout\",\n            \"refresh supersedes stale detection and failed cold refresh remains retryable\",\n            \"project removal evicts in-flight context state\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-remove-project-purge-leak.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"removing one project evicts its authority-scoped agent inventory without disturbing another project\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/lib/agent-session/launch/new-tab/launch-agent-in-new-tab.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"the advertised Floating agent launches in a Floating tab with null runtime ownership and no paired-runtime create call\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]",
        "Renderer direct-owner cleanup retires the complete launch-agent-in-new-tab suite (six registrations/ten examples). Lost alarms cover child cwd/trust scope, captured host/selection ownership and creation settlement, precreation refusal, canonical args/model fallback, oversized Windows draft paste, and late-SSH status fencing. Owning private capability fixture state was consumed. No equivalent replacement, fresh execution, native process/provider, rendered UI, performance, or cross-platform result is claimed. Other source mappings and the existing independent manual Windows receipt keep their prior scope; retained shortcut/SourceControl/continuation cases do not replace these alarms. Historical removed active mappings (verbatim semantic values; no longer active): [{\"field\":\"testFiles\",\"previous\":[\"src/renderer/src/lib/agent-session/launch/new-tab/launch-agent-in-new-tab.test.ts\"]},{\"field\":\"assertionRefs\",\"previous\":[{\"file\":\"src/renderer/src/lib/agent-session/launch/new-tab/launch-agent-in-new-tab.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"the advertised Floating agent launches in a Floating tab with null runtime ownership and no paired-runtime create call\"]}]},{\"field\":\"commands\",\"previous\":[\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/hooks/useDetectedAgents.test.tsx src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/detected-agents.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/slices/agent-inventory/local-detected-agent-state.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-group-create-race.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-groups-delete.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/repos-project-groups-owner-routing.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/projects/repos-project-host-capability.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/projects/repos-project-host-lifecycle.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-remove-project-purge-leak.test.ts src/renderer/src/store/repos/repos-update-serialization.test.ts src/rende