less host after a cold restart; lists every persisted terminal in the all-worktrees inventory after a cold restart; lists persisted editor tabs beside the terminals after a cold restart; restores a persisted split group layout on the cold rebuild; restores the saved active group of a split even when it is not the first group; falls back to the active tab group when the saved active group was not restored; keeps the headless group active when there is no persisted split; keeps phone and CLI creates in the group they joined across a cold restart. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-removal-failed-retry.spec.ts: lists the leftover with its error, though Git no longer does; takes the normal delete once Git registers a checkout at the path again; joins a retry another client started while this Delete listed Git; shows the failed row with its error, not the scan cached before the delete. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-removal-execution-host.spec.ts: refuses an SSH row whose host is unreachable instead of deleting here; refuses a runtime row with no nested SSH target rather than deleting locally; refuses a runtime row that also names a nested SSH target; retains runtime purge dispatch in a recovery job; uses the runtime helper override before resuming an interrupted removal; uses the runtime helper override before retrying a failed removal; captures the watcher callback and retains its job-host receiver; reads the current runtime removal queue. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-spawn-dispatch.spec.ts: reports the spawn request before it leaves for the pty controller; reports it even when the spawn itself then fails; does not report it when the create fails before any spawn request; captures the admission method before reading the incarnation; captures the record method before evaluating its state object; skips database payload serialization when no database exists; skips a throwing database payload when no database exists; keeps the database method and receiver captured before its payload; captures the canonical map method before a binding getter changes it; completes the captured replacement fence without another map lookup. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/host-ownership/pty-connection-ssh-hook-status-authority.spec.ts: leaves SSH IPC OSC 9999 status ownership in the main runtime. Existing unrelated evidenceRuns retain their original scope; unchanged dated receipt objects do not validate changed source bytes or reduced selectors. No fresh gate execution or historical import-closure equivalence is claimed.",
