e equivalence, fresh execution, real network/provider/SSH, rendered UI, mobile, mixed-version or cross-platform validation is claimed. Audit2371 reduces all-host-folder-workspace-catalogs.test.ts by removing the repeated offline compatibility-probe budget and its incidental local-fallback/restored-owner samples, and catalog-settlement-notifications.test.ts by removing the four-route ten-equal-refresh notification/reference matrix. Those probe, quietness, identity and fallback alarms are intentionally lost. Remaining stale-response and revision-fencing examples do not supply equivalent replacement coverage. No fresh execution or red/green evidence validates the reduced sources; the four unrelated physical selected-runtime E2E receipts retain their original commands and scope. Historical prior account (preserved verbatim): Audit2360 removes src/renderer/src/hooks/useIpcEvents-terminal-create-surfacing.test.ts and its exclusive fake-effect harness. Lose local default-runtime persistence across navigation; focused/background terminal request/create/reveal and no-focus recovery; startup cwd/config/agent/view-mode forwarding; explicit runtime-session routing; remote/ambiguous/missing owner refusal; history focus; existing PTY reuse/title preservation; pending tab PTY/layout/identity adoption; split tree, focus, identity and telemetry samples. No equivalent replacement claimed. Changed selectors have no fresh execution or red/green credit. Unrelated retained receipt objects keep their original narrow scope. Historical prior account (preserved verbatim): Audit2056 (sources2054/2055): Intentionally retire these low-value alarms without replacement: src/renderer/src/store/project-groups/nested-repository-operations.test.ts: routes local nested scan progress by scanId and unsubscribes after completion. Existing unrelated evidenceRuns retain their original scope; unchanged dated receipt objects do not validate changed source bytes or reduced selectors. No fresh gate execution or historical import-closure equivalence is claimed. Historical prior account (preserved verbatim): Retained exact unchanged-source receipts remain the only current execution evidence. Reduced selectors have no fresh execution result. Historical pre-audit oracle account for changed sources: The retained unchanged-source receipts are the only current execution evidence; reduced-source assertions await validation. Historical oracle account (not a current claim for changed sources): The retained unchanged-source receipts are the only current execution evidence; reduced-source assertions await validation. Historical oracle account (not a current claim for changed sources): The retained unchanged-source receipts are the only current execution evidence; reduced-source assertions await validation. Historical oracle account (not a current claim for changed sources): Start with Active Server=Local desktop, connect and navigate Windows 2, then reveal a local terminal and assert it succeeds while the persisted preference remains local before and after restart. Repeat transient routing and selected-runtime Add Project operations with exact-ID host decoys and completion reordering. Separately pair the real web client to an isolated headed host, then make its sole still-listed runtime compatibility-blocked and unavailable. Require a null authoritative selection, a disabled host option, and disabled Browse, Clone, and Create actions with no local fallback. Repeat against headless serve. Run the byte-identical selector/action contract on latest main, candidate, and candidate with the eligibility seam disabled.",
