receipts remain unchanged and apply only to their unchanged selectors. Changed optional selectors have no new execution result. Audit1401: src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-duplicate-pty-repair.spec.ts removed. Loses listing-on-already-repaired-data alarm; it never established runtime repair invocation. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-split-agent-tab.spec.ts removed. Loses actual mobile split sibling shell versus recorded-agent resume command alarms; no equivalent coverage asserted. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-native-chat-setup.spec.ts removed. Loses separate setup/startup tab result in that manually assembled path. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime.test.ts reduced. Driver registration/import of a whole-deleted selected spec is removed; directly authored cases remain unchanged. No extra authored removal credit. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. Existing exact unaffected receipts remain unchanged and apply only to their unchanged selectors. Changed optional selectors have no new execution result. Audit1402: src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection-park-reveal-model-snapshot.spec.ts reduced. Loses basic paired serialize/initial replay forwarding check; hidden alt-frame grid/precedence policy remains. No real terminal renderer claim. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. The existing primary-selector receipt and its claims remain scoped to their unchanged sources; the broad optional command has no new execution result. Audit1412: src/main/runtime/mobile-session-tabs-agent-status-heartbeat.test.ts reduced. Loses FIFO fairness/spacing, semantic bypass/cancellation, delayed-boundary scheduling and teardown timer-cleanup alarms. Retained fixed emission cases do not replace those outcomes. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed.",
