n CLI arguments on a decline; opens the chat on the server that admitted it; opens only the terminal when this machine declines, without a notice; opens a new agent tab's terminal with the typed prompt when the caller names none; opens the chat, not a terminal, when this machine cannot resolve a new workspace yet; keeps its terminal fallback, as before. tests/e2e/structured-attention-prompt-relay.unit.test.ts: settles once per relayed prompt, not on every later status update. tests/e2e/structured-attention-read-retirement.unit.test.ts: Mark read on a chat never opened withdraws the prompt alert it surfaced; Mark read on a chat hidden since an earlier view covers the newer prompt it surfaced; reads a newly accepted visible prompt without sending an RPC for text-only updates. tests/e2e/structured-chat-tab-lifetime-cost.unit.test.ts: counts real raw stores, unrelated window publications and captured cleanup at %i chats; counts complete supplied-member sweep and separate final retirement at S=%i N=%i. tests/e2e/structured-session-workspace-authority.unit.test.ts: bounds actual target reveal across %i repo roots and metadata aliases. tests/e2e/terminal-agent-pane-launch.unit.test.ts: starts the host's planned command once, at the pane's size, and says it started; plans a pane whose prompt the window submits without the startup update prompt; preserves caller shell-ready delivery only for a connection-scoped adapter ($connectionId); starts no shell on plan failure (original failure: $returnLaunchFailure); cannot confirm a start whose provider answer was lost. tests/e2e/terminal-shortcuts.spec.ts: @headful Codex-like background output stays visible without disabling WebGL in auto mode; Shift with Russian layout text reaches the PTY as Cyrillic under kitty keyboard reporting. tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency.spec.ts: records attributed CWD, spawn, bind, fixture-ready, input, and echo phases. tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency-phases.ts: dedicated zero-ca