        "Audit1983: Remove the reasonless-close selector and narrow census aliases to actual retained runtime and injected-inventory callbacks. The removed synthetic census-dedup and isolated pre-boundary timing cases receive no replacement credit; preserve17 unrelated dated receipts. Changed-source prior results do not validate reduced-source bytes. No fresh execution, equivalent replacement, red/green, measured budget, soak, provider/PTY, rendered, live remote/mobile or cross-platform result is claimed.",
