        "Audit1991: Remove initial-snapshot sequence-domain, limited-tail/truncation and unknown-output-sequence aliases whose callbacks are removed. The source retains partial-chunk replay and requested-snapshot retry/admission at supplied snapshot/data seams, not equivalent replacement or measured retained-memory proof. Preserve the existing stream/pending-wait capacity aliases only to their retained owning multiplex callbacks with supplied PTY resolutions. Removing the sibling-PTY heartbeat dedup work-count sample does not establish a new decorative fanout budget; the unrelated-PTY cancellation fence survives. Preserve17 unrelated dated receipts. Changed-source prior results do not validate reduced-source bytes. No fresh execution, equivalent replacement, red/green, measured budget, soak, physical provider/PTY, rendered, live remote/mobile or cross-platform result is claimed.",
