      "coverageNotes": "NEXT46 terminal-owner layout and whole-case policy: src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/snapshots/replay-guard.test.ts. Complete retired/reduced selectors lose their listed alarms; retained cases have no transferred historical pass or equivalent replacement coverage. Unaffected dated receipts retain only their original exact scopes. This metadata edit is not fresh execution evidence. Historical prior account (preserved verbatim): Retained renderer unit cases exercise guard release after a silent stalled parse and hardcoded breadcrumb event/pane identity with a fake terminal and mocked recorder. The identity-rich hashing/redaction registration was retired whole. No hashed tab/worktree/leaf identity, path-redaction, diagnostics-bundle export, live provider or packaged runtime coverage is claimed.",
