med entries from retention after a bounded drain. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-transport/remote-runtime/remote-runtime-pty-transport-prebind-discard-notice.test.ts: says nothing once the pane is closed. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/render-health/terminal-webgl-atlas-recovery.test.ts: refreshes after each scheduled atlas reset; falls back to a timeout when animation frames are unavailable; continues recovery when a manager throws after scheduling. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/snapshots/pty-buffer-serializer.test.ts: tracks a remounted quiet title source even when the stale owner unregisters later; preserves the renderer-parsed output sequence in the response; preserves a pending escape tail for snapshot replay; routes a host's Reset Terminal request to the pane that owns the PTY. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/snapshots/saved-terminal-output-replay.test.ts: marks panes with restored scrollback for fresh-shell viewport blanking. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/viewport/split-right-white-screen.test.ts: recovers a 0x0 spawn whose container is briefly unmeasurable then settles. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/viewport/visibility/stale-document-visibility.test.ts: removes global listeners when the last pane unregisters. src/renderer/src/components/ui/security-surface-theme-contrast.test.tsx: keeps trust text readable on a host-owned dialog surface; applies the hostile surface to ordinary dialogs, so the case above is exercised. src/renderer/src/components/use-terminal-parking-pass.test.tsx: does not queue a render when a pass produces the same parking sets; keeps parking transitions working under StrictMode. src/renderer/src/hooks/client-workspace-view-report.test.ts: reports an away user’s screen with no presence, and renews as soon as input returns; retries a failed send, empty or not, no sooner than a refresh. src/renderer/src/hooks/ipc-events/terminal-request-ipc-bridge-placement.test.ts: is ne