he quit latch when the renderer prevents unload; does not notify the crash recorder when renderer teardown follows a confirmed window close; allows close when Electron reports a crashed webContents; requests confirmation for a hung-but-alive renderer instead of bypassing. src/main/workspaces/catalog/worktree-identity-persistence.test.ts: stores independent metadata for colliding locators on two hosts; projects canonical-only metadata for exactly one host; keeps canonical metadata current for legacy writers on a known owner; removes only the selected legacy-owner metadata when locators collide; keeps the canonical identity stable when the locator changes; leaves other hosts at the old locator when one host renames its folder. src/main/wsl/filesystem/wsl-drive-unc-conversion-startup.test.ts: leaves a journaled conversion untouched with the gate closed, %s. src/main/wsl/orcad/wsl-orcad-deploy.test.ts: holds the distro before it deploys and launches, and reports what C5 dials; passes its connect-state read (%s) on as hints; applies the SSH census and downgrade admission to the first deploy; refuses a WSL 1 distro before holding it or touching its files; tells an unregistered distro how to find the installed ones, before holding anything; surfaces an unsupported libc as the SSH host refusal does; starts an already-active slot the distro stop ended, instead of reporting it ready; deploys over an adopted unrecorded orcad under the SSH terminal gate, never a fresh launch; reports the adopted instance once the same version is serving; returns a deferral rather than launching over live terminals; hands a failed first deploy to the fresh-install cleanup before reporting it. src/main/zcode/zcode-v2-plan-credentials.test.ts: prefers migrated credentials over a stale legacy account; keeps legacy support when no personal v2 file exists; honors the upstream personal config override independently of the credential directory; does not borrow credentials from another execution host; p