        "Audit2404 removes whole skill-share-package-name.test.ts, skill-delete-plan original1/6 skill-delete-recovery original2 and skill-share-preparation original2. Lose lookup503 rejection/status propagation through prepare, explicit unblocked unordered alias-kind/canonical sample with cwd undefined, stale classification after +60000ms actual mtime change, successful first-pass single-move rollback/staged-path absence and prior-process preparation-root archive directory cleanup. Retained exact identities use cwd home; public stale guard submits timestamp1; recovery retry cases are not identical first-pass fixtures. No equivalent complete replacement or fresh validation is claimed.",
