        "Audit3335 composes adopted source unions3327/3328 and3330/3332: intentionally retires100 authored registrations/123 expanded cases, including ten whole suites, without equivalent replacement. Lost alarms include seeded host persistence/contention and stale-host cleanup; browser snapshot assembly; mocked wake/DPR callbacks and frame budgets; preflight projections; palette authority/cache suppression, URL intent and saved-title cross-repo collisions; metadata coverage/set patch and dropdown assembly; and removed terminal, worktree, review-refresh and owner-routing examples. Retained definitions do not replace these alarms. This broad root unit command selects the reduced suite; no fresh execution, historical source/import equivalence, real provider/network/SSH, rendered UI/GPU/focus, durability restart, mobile, mixed-version or cross-platform validation is claimed. Unrelated dated receipts retain only their original scope.",
        "Audit3342 composes adopted source batches3333/3334,3336/3337 and3340/3341: intentionally retires180 authored registrations/263 expanded cases, including seven whole suites, without equivalent replacement. Lost alarms include corrupt editor hydration; mobile editor/diff publication and privacy projections; stale-resubscribe routing; model-picker projection/refetch/retry/fallback; editor check-details and frame property inventories; latched-pane cleanup/quiescence; client create replay identity/options/compatibility; and removed owner, async routing, terminal and layout examples. Retained definitions do not replace these alarms. This broad root unit command selects the reduced suite; no fresh execution, historical source/import equivalence, real provider/network/SSH, rendered UI, durability restart, mobile, mixed-version or cross-platform validation is claimed. Unrelated dated receipts keep their original scope.",
        "Audit3349 composes adopted batches3343,3345 and refreshed3354: intentionally retires234 authored registrations/294 expanded cases, including13 whole suites, without equivalent replacement. Lost alarms include supplied terminal reconnect/replacement/typeahead/mirror/result and snapshot examples; synthetic render-desync persistence/recovery; worktree listing/owner/catalog/lineage/removal and activation/creation examples; host-scoped PR and task-record projections; editor diff/status/comment and UI send-target examples; automation observation/wake, supplied sleep/deadline clock and native-chat completion/notification/relaunch samples; held-tab layout and cleanup/progress guard examples. Retained adverse-ordering and wire-boundary cases are narrower and do not replace all removed alarms. The already-upstream visibility-resume deletion receives zero new removal credit. This broad unit command selects the reduced suite; no fresh execution, historical import equivalence, real provider/network/SSH, native process/power/GPU, rendered UI, mobile, mixed-version or cross-platform validation is claimed. Unrelated dated receipts retain their original scope.",
        "Audit3359 composes root-adopted source3355/independent3356: intentionally retires130 authored registrations/139 expanded cases, including eight whole suites, without equivalent replacement. Lost alarms include strict create naming/capability/legacy payloads; supplied transport host replacement, deadline reattach, create-handoff and split activation; agent-session fork/clipboard/platform flags; shutdown cleared-scrollback/unmounted bindings; simulator host-collision/selection/shutdown; and removed editor, catalog, mutation, launch and status examples. Retained12 adverse-ordering/state-consequence cases are narrower and do not replace all removed alarms. Two queue absences receive zero removal credit. This broad unit command selects the reduced suite; no fresh execution, historical import equivalence, real provider/network/SSH/PTY, filesystem restart, native UI, mobile, mixed-version or cross-platform validation is claimed. Unrelated dated receipts retain their original scope.",
        "Audit3362 composes root-adopted3358/independent3360: intentionally retires129 authored registrations/140 expanded cases, including four whole suites, without equivalent replacement. Lost alarms include supplied orphan-adoption retry/malformed inventory/cancellation; fake-terminal replay parser/wedge/disposal callbacks; all-host catalog metadata and Windows preferences; host keepalive/protocol/stale/settings failures; and removed exact-stop/suppression, source save lifetime, diff-note queue, rename/editor close, input flood/chunk refusal/limits, purge and creation examples. Retained18 registrations/21 expanded cases protect narrower ownership, generation, dirty-state, queue convergence, encoding and attachment-lease outcomes. No replacement or keeper quota claim. This broad unit command selects the reduced suite; no fresh execution, historical import equivalence, real provider/network/SSH/PTY/xterm parser, disk restart, native UI, mobile, mixed-version or cross-platform validation is claimed. Unrelated dated receipts retain their original scope.",
        "Audit3368 composes root-adopted3363/3364 and3367/3369: intentionally retires181 authored registrations/196 expanded cases, including28 whole suites, without equivalent replacement. Lost alarms include hibernation attention/liveness/backoff/sequential teardown and inventory, host launch compatibility/legacy/Kimi/resource cleanup, terminal recovery parser/pause/quarantine/remount, window-visibility omission-fence lifetime, launch-option rendered Start, sleeping-resume saved recipe/WSL quoting/cancellation, plus removed project/window/input variants. Additional tiny-suite losses include sentence/label/field/default inventories, credential omission, Windows argument/environment mapping, URI decoding, diagnostics, provider classification and fake-clock callback/parser examples. Retained ten registrations/twelve expanded cases include two literal Unicode Mn/Cf zero-width range guards in the actual character-range algorithm and protect narrower delayed editor bytes/destructive ownership, mounted hidden collision repair, ten transport epochs, duplicate-command refusal, caller timeout typing, executor unknown-opener refusal and failed-chunk user bytes. This broad unit command selects the reduced suite; no fresh runtime, real provider/network/PTY, filesystem restart, native UI, historical import equivalence, mobile, mixed-version or cross-platform validation is claimed. Unrelated dated receipts retain their original scope.",
        "Audit3375 composes root-adopted3370/independent3371 and3373/independent3374: intentionally retires79 authored registrations/84 expanded cases, including39 whole suites, without equivalent replacement. Lost alarms include federation field/parser inventories; Claude rejected-key precedence, credential clone redaction, managed-versus-user hook preservation and CLI defaults; setting/status/activity projections, mocked SSH/notification/reveal/Linear refusal, fake-clock reconnect and noise; image-fold artifact visibility, paste eligibility, setup trust, scripted ACP error-to-journal publication and ligature cache tuple aliasing; plus supplied folder-runner uniqueness, mobile host-overlay/credential/update/preference races, status/markup/title/keyed-row projections, subscriber cleanup, cancellation/close/refusal/link-issue and mirror suppression alarms. Retained3373 merger contiguity, dual-clock overdue-resume exactly-once, rejected-paste IPC sink and annotation schema roundtrip remain bounded. Retained actual HTTP/OSC status composition, destructive sibling-filesystem isolation, external contrast invariant and fixture CSS pixel intervention remain narrower. Original reviewed87authored/92expanded become9/9; current OpenCode suite adds two preserved upstream cases and the synthetic-title suite gained one Cursor policy mock-call case, independently reviewed for removal in root3378; current90/95 become11/11. That Cursor suppression/ready-frame regression alarm is intentionally lost; it does not observe native title ownership or tab flicker. For3370 only the peer was independently blind, with author exposure explicit;3373/3374 both blind pins were verified. This broad root unit command selects the reduced root unit suite; UNIT_INCLUDE excludes mobile tests, which require the existing mobile runner; retained Playwright component-pixel spec uses its separate existing headless fixture runner and is not validated by the broad unit command. No fresh execution, actual agent