        "Audit3342 historical original commands object, preserved verbatim; retired objects are not active evidence or replacement coverage:\n\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-transport/remote-runtime/remote-runtime-pty-transport-host-surface-replacement.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-transport/remote-runtime/remote-runtime-pty-transport-stream-reconnect.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-transport/remote-runtime/remote-runtime-pty-transport-expired-pane-recovery.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-transport/remote-runtime/remote-runtime-pty-transport-create-outcome-recovery.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-transport/remote-runtime/remote-runtime-pty-transport-create-handoff.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-transport/remote-runtime/recovery/remote-runtime-pty-recovery-state.test.ts src/shared/remote-runtime/remote-runtime-socket-liveness.test.ts src/shared/remote-runtime/control/remote-runtime-shared-control-connection.test.ts src/shared/remote-runtime/control/remote-runtime-shared-control-socket-generation.test.ts src/shared/remote-runtime/remote-runtime-client-error-classification.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/remote-runtime-server-heartbeat.test.ts src/main/runtime/terminal/launch/orca-runtime-terminal-create-idempotency.test.ts\"",
