        "Audit2095 current-parent preparation2126 (approved2092/2093 removals; source refresh2109/independent2112): Intentionally retire these low-value alarms without replacement: tests/e2e/automation-terminal-launch.unit.test.ts: launches explicit Chat for %s through the common entry and keeps its actual fallback; does not apply stored Terminal extras to Chat; forwards only complete Chat-consumed values, with no Terminal startup base; refuses an expired admission without minting another launch identity; records the actual chat identity and delegates new workspace setup and provenance. tests/e2e/github-project-provider-columns.unit.test.ts: renders %s through one bounded items request on a named cloud host; preserves zero and complete counters: %j; preserves populated and legacy rows through shared sorting, grouping and cells. tests/e2e/structured-agent-session-launch-continuation.unit.test.ts: carries renderer lifetime through host intent to the real %s provider builders. tests/e2e/terminal-account-restart.unit.test.ts: replaces a tombstoned owner while its persisted pane binding has not yet been cleared; paired restart retains the old owner (host authority: %s). tests/e2e/terminal-hidden-view-parking.spec.ts: does not park excluded tabs; reproduces a static frame byte-for-byte across 25 park/reveal cycles. tests/e2e/terminal-long-table-scroll-restore.spec.ts: reproduces long markdown table artifacts after workspace switch and scroll; keeps narrow wrapped signer markdown table coherent after restore and scroll; keeps real emoji markdown table right edge clean after restore and scroll. tests/e2e/terminal-long-table-fixtures.ts: dedicated zero-case helper retirement; no authored test credit. tests/e2e/terminal-paste-ownership.spec.ts: Windows multiline keyboard paste normalizes terminal newlines with one PTY owner; right-click paste sends clipboard text to the focused terminal exactly once. tests/e2e/terminal-raw-emoji-table-scroll-restore.spec.ts: uses WebGL by default for ordinary terminal output when available @terminal-rendering-golden. tests/e2e/terminal-windows-shell-paste-ownership.spec.ts: cmd.exe default terminal keyboard paste preserves exact content with one PTY owner; Git Bash default terminal keyboard paste preserves POSIX-shaped content with one PTY owner; WSL terminal keyboard paste preserves Linux shell content with one PTY owner. tests/e2e/workspace-board-lane-virtualization.spec.ts: mounts a window of cards for a large lane and keeps lane indexes; renders later lane indexes after the lane scrolls. Current changed source bytes, wrapper registrations and reduced selectors have no fresh execution or red/green credit. Unrelated surviving receipt objects keep their original narrow scope; current literal graph reachability does not establish historical import closure or equivalent replacement coverage. Current conservative command/import graph reaches tests/e2e/automation-terminal-launch.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/github-project-provider-columns.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/structured-agent-session-launch-continuation.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-account-restart.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-hidden-view-parking.spec.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-long-table-scroll-restore.spec.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-long-table-fixtures.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-paste-ownership.spec.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-raw-emoji-table-scroll-restore.spec.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-windows-shell-paste-ownership.spec.ts, tests/e2e/workspace-board-lane-virtualization.spec.ts. Unresolved local/computed edges remain explicit debt. Complete dated receipts with direct selectors or current literal graph reaching tests/e2e/automation-terminal-launch.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/github-project-provider-columns.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/structured-agent-session-launch-continuation.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-account-restart.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-hidden-view-parking.spec.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-long-table-scroll-restore.spec.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-long-table-fixture