        "Audit2090 (sources2088/2089): Intentionally retire these low-value alarms without replacement: tests/e2e/terminal-option-composed-ascii.spec.ts: still reports the Alt chord when Option is configured as Alt. Existing unrelated evidenceRuns retain their original scope; unchanged dated receipt objects do not validate changed source bytes or reduced selectors. No fresh gate execution or historical import-closure equivalence is claimed. Frozen current literal-import graph reaches these changed test bytes; unresolved local and computed edges remain debt, and current reachability is not historical execution or equivalent replacement evidence. The historical receipt/currentCommand selecting tests/e2e/terminal-option-composed-ascii.spec.ts remains historical and is not a passing result for the reduced current command.",
