        "Audit1361 historical platform/provider scope before source changes: {\"coveredPlatforms\":[\"macos\",\"linux\"],\"coveredProviders\":[]}. Remaining provider scope applies only to unchanged-source receipts.",
        "Audit1361 historical assertion inventory for deleted/reduced sources; not current validated assertions:\n[\n  {\n    \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/dashboard-popout/preview-terminal-snapshot-replay.test.ts\",\n    \"assertions\": [\n      \"a Preview opened on a snapshot carrying flags 8 adopts 8 before any live output\",\n      \"a replacement snapshot whose ANSI carries no kitty bytes keeps its proven flags, and a proven 0 clears an earlier 8\",\n      \"a missing field leaves the mirror unproven at the raw-text fallback and a later live negotiation still upgrades it\",\n      \"restored flags land on the screen the snapshot scan selected\",\n      \"a proven post-snapshot suffix advances the stack while redelivered bytes apply idempotently\"\n    ]\n  }\n]",
        "Audit1391: src/renderer/src/lib/pane-manager/terminal-ime-candidate-anchor.test.ts reduced. Lose explicit one-read/unchanged-style work budget across 30 syllables and single-timer burst alarm. Synthetic screen bounds/terminal cursor bound retained proof to DOM anchor updates, not actual OS IME placement. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/terminal-kitty-csi-u-encoding.test.ts reduced. Lose explicit PC-101 alternate omission, multi-codepoint/control associated text filtering, lock modifier integer, shifted punctuation, standalone separator and printable nonfunctional keypad fallbacks. Retained pure encoding is a wire-contract check without host input delivery. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. Historical removed assertion inventory: [{\"file\":\"src/renderer/src/lib/pane-manager/terminal-ime-candidate-anchor.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"keeps forced layout at one read per composition across a Hangul burst\",\"coalesces the deferred Cursor Agent re-apply to one timer per burst\",\"keeps typed follow-ups anchored after recognizing the initial Cursor Agent screen\",\"refreshes the deferred metrics and anchor after a refit\"]},{\"file\":\"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/terminal-kitty-csi-u-encoding.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"report-all Option events encode exact alternate, repeat, release, and associated-text fields\",\"report-all native commits preserve unresolved layout characters and distinguish functional from printable numpad identities\",\"associated text omits forbidden control codepoints\",\"release events omit associated text and sparse PC-101 alternates retain their parameter position\",\"CapsLock and NumLock occupy their protocol modifier bits\"]}]",
        "Audit1396: src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/xterm-bypass-policy.test.ts reduced. Lose standalone handled Ctrl, Shift+Space, shifted non-ASCII keydown and active-composition backspace/arrow/text/Process suppression alarms. No actual IME/PTY encoding occurs. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. Historical removed assertion inventory: [{\"file\":\"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/xterm-bypass-policy.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"macOS standalone Process key behavior and composition-owned key suppression stay intact\"]}]",
        "Audit1402: src/renderer/src/lib/keyboard-layout/option-as-alt-probe.test.ts removed. Intentionally loses invalidation, focus/manual refresh gating and stale/newest generation settlement outcomes, including direct stale category suppression. No equivalent replacement or default preload input-source delivery claim. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/terminal-ime-substituted-text-commit.test.ts removed. Intentionally loses substituted sentence punctuation, shifted/backslash/multi-unit/full-width/letter input and Kitty flag/release/report encoding alarms across14 authored registrations. No equivalent replacement or real pane/browser input delivery claim. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed. Historical removed assertion inventory: [{\"file\":\"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/terminal-ime-substituted-text-commit.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"synthetic and native input-source paths are classified for covered fixtures\",\"report-all commits retain the unshifted physical key while associated text carries the committed substitution\"]},{\"file\":\"src/renderer/src/lib/keyboard-layout/option-as-alt-probe.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"a stale asynchronous input-source probe cannot overwrite the newest classification\",\"an input-source notification changes the classification to unknown synchronously before refreshing\"]}]",
        "Audit1417 intentionally reduces src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/terminal-ime-candidate-key-release-guard.test.ts: Loses direct timestamp-formula assertion; no useful independent alarm in removed registration. No equivalent replacement coverage or fresh result is claimed.",
        "Audit1876 removes the standalone native keyboard snapshot parser suite, direct input-source invalidation/fanout, quit/native teardown and non-macOS subscription examples, and preview-output fully covered/newer/missing-metadata/unsequenced examples. Those direct alarms are intentionally lost without equivalent replacement coverage. Retained notification cases exercise latest-generation coalescing; retained preview cases exercise only partial sequenced suffix slicing and transformed-overlap replay. Existing native/E2E/trace receipts keep their original commands, results and counts; focused survivor runs do not validate the broad IME selector or physical native/platform behavior.",
        "Audit1878 removes the direct non-negative safe-integer snapshot-flags validator table from terminal-kitty-keyboard-mode-tracker.test.ts. Active-screen proof and known-zero/provenance state tests remain, without equivalent replacement coverage or a new whole-gate result. Existing dated receipts retain their original source scope.",
        "Audit1888 removes the entire candidate-key-release-guard and composition-tracker suites. Direct candidate predicate/map, held-repeat, expiry, changed-modifier and overlapping-release alarms, plus composition active/stale/trailing-guard/reset alarms, are intentionally lost. It reduces placeholder-mask: frame/lookalike/stock-draft inventories and simple end/dispose cleanup alarms are lost; real xterm draft visibility, blur without end/repaint, live reclassification and newest-session ownership remain. Native-text-forwarder loses structural claim, direct forwarding/encoding inventories, early-keyup/modifier/tombstone/transaction/disposal examples; only NumLock press-pinned release identity, swallowed-repeat release obligation and negotiation-pop suppression remain. The standalone Mac remap expected-text case is removed; captured remap plus an explicitly DERIVED neighbour remains. Four pre-audit assertionRefs are retired below as historical inventory, with no equivalent replacement claim. Retained tests use simulated events, flags, frames and transport; this is not native IME/substitution, real host/PTY, focus, soak or measured-budget validation. All five active IME receipts remain raw unchanged because their exact selectors are unaffected: four Electron receipts and the byte-exact unchanged fcitx4 replay suite/currentCommand. Other active selectors/assertions, coverage/maturity accounting, and all prior notes remain unchanged.",
        "Audit1888 historical assertion inventory for removed/reduced suites; not current validated assertions. Original raw assertion objects follow:\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-candidate-key-release-guard.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"suppressed candidate keydown arms only the matching keypress/keyup release guard\",\n            \"held-key repeat keydowns stay guarded until their keyup, even past expiry\",\n            \"fresh keydowns, other keys, modified keys, and expired keypresses are not guarded, and a fresh press drops a stale pending release\"\n          ]\n        }\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-composition-tracker.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"empty Sogou-style compositionupdate keeps composition active\",\n            \"stale composition state expires so editing keys cannot stay suppressed indefinitely\",\n            \"post-composition candidate guard is armed only by Sogou-style empty updates and clears after real typing\"\n          ]\n        }\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-composer-placeholder-mask.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"a bold Codex prompt row with a dimmed model footer below a blank gap, and a framed Claude prompt, acquire the mask class only while composing\",\n            \"the same placeholder text without its footer or frame, and arbitrary dimmed output, acquire nothing\",\n            \"a row carrying typed text acquires no mask even while the stock placeholder is still rendered to its right\",\n            \"the class is gone after composition end, after a blur with no session end behind it, and after disposal\"\n          ]\n        }\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-native-text-forwarder.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"native text commits route once to the intended PTY\",\n            \"composition/preedit bookkeeping does not leak premature text\",\n            \"multi-codepoint committed text is reported independently from physical key identity\"\n          ]\n        }",
        "Audit1896 removes the entire synthetic local-echo trailing-preedit suite, CSI-u encoding table, Option-compose scalar policy, non-Mac/Mac bypass matrices and runtime-prefix projection suite. Their direct overlay, scalar key/flag encoding, bypass/suppression and environment-projection alarms are intentionally lost. The removed paste-runtime suite only projects supplied PTY-prefix/runtime-environment values; runtime-environment selection does not validate payload forwarding or deduplication. Its retired duplicate-payload assertion overstated that test and is preserved verbatim only as historical inventory. It reduces midline-preedit-tail to competing final-cell caret/candidate anchor owners with supplied geometry and actual xterm buffer repaint under an open preedit: arbitrary dimmed-output, simple cleanup, other row-tail/style inventories and nearby geometry cases are lost. Resumed-preedit-visibility retains only commit/cleanup of an update-inferred transaction; recorded/ordinary-neighbour reactivation examples are removed. Option-kitty-release retains only first-sender ownership across autorepeat versus fresh-press replacement of an orphaned owner: live modifier/layout/NumLock identity, native dead-key and negotiation/mode-pop inventories are lost. Three complete assertionRefs are retired and three narrowed; all six prior raw objects are archived below as historical inventory. Tests use synthetic DOM events, supplied geometry/state and callback/transport sinks, with no native IME/keyboard, current device, real PTY, ConPTY, remote runtime, focus/app, soak or measured-budget validation. No equivalent replacement is claimed. All five active IME receipts retain exact unaffected selectors and raw objects; all230 current receipts, prior knownGap literals and unrelated accounting/fields are preserved. This note records scope loss only and promotes no new execution evidence.",
        "Audit1896 historical assertion inventory for three retired and three narrowed refs; not current validated assertions. Original raw assertion objects follow:\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-xterm-trailing-preedit-occlusion.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"rolling Korean input keeps only the uncommitted trailing syllable in the themed overlay\",\n            \"the overlay remains anchored to the live cursor cell and clears after commit\"\n          ]\n        }\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/keyboard/xterm-bypass-policy-non-mac.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"standalone Linux 229 keydowns reach xterm while Windows 229 keydowns stay suppressed\",\n            \"candidate Space/digit selectors are suppressed only while candidate guards are active\"\n          ]\n        }\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/paste/terminal-paste-runtime.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\"paste/runtime forwarding avoids duplicate terminal payloads\"]\n        }\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-xterm-midline-preedit-tail.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"a mid-line preedit reproduces committed cells hidden by its opaque overlay and refreshes that tail after terminal renders\",\n            \"arbitrary fully dimmed output remains visible even at column zero\",\n            \"the final-column caret stays visible and the textarea candidate anchor shifts left with an over-wide preedit\",\n            \"cancel, empty resumed updates, and disposal remove transient overlay state\"\n          ]\n        }\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-xterm-resumed-preedit-visibility.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"recorded Windows Korean compositionupdate-without-compositionstart traces reactivate a visible preedit transaction\",\n            \"the resumed transaction commits exactly once and cleans up normally\",\n            \"the ordinary Linux compositionstart sequence remains unchanged\"\n          ]\n        }\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/keyboard/terminal-option-kitty-release.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"owned releases use live Shift and Option state and current alternate-key flags\",\n            \"owned releases retain the delivered press identity across layout, Shift, and NumLock changes\",\n            \"a native dead-key keyup is consumed without inventing an unmatched protocol release\",\n            \"event-type pop consumes without bytes and repeat keydowns cannot replace the original release owner\"\n          ]\n        }",
        "Renderer direct-owner cleanup retires the complete layout-base-character suite (one registration). Lost alarm: layout invalidation blocks focus refresh, fences an older snapshot, and accepts the new-generation character. The removed case consumed private snapshot/reset state and internal refresh-count accounting. No equivalent replacement or new execution is claimed. Remaining IME/keyboard/provider sources and the unchanged fcitx4 receipt retain their existing bounded qualifications; this removal does not validate their selectors. Historical removed active mappings (verbatim semantic values; no longer active): [{\"field\":\"testFiles\",\"previous\":[\"src/renderer/src/lib/keyboard-layout/layout-base-character.test.ts\"]},{\"field\":\"commands\",\"previous\":[\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/keyboard/terminal-option-kitty-release.test.ts src/renderer/src/lib/keyboard-layout/layout-base-character.test.ts src/main/ipc/macos-keyboard-layout-change-notifications.test.ts src/preload/app-restart-checkpoint-routing.test.ts src/renderer/src/web/web-preload-api-ui.test.ts\"]}]",
        "Audit3460 final-v2 composes accepted AUTHOR3454/PEER3455 on actual post263 main: intentionally removes99 authored/106 potential expanded cases across16 selected drivers, including7 whole suites, retaining24 authored/26 potential cases. No equivalent replacement or fresh runtime is claimed. The complete mocked AgentTerminalPreview component suite is removed, including the snapshot-proven kitty mirror forwarding alarm. Remove its active file, command token and assertion reference; the other IME drivers are unchanged and do not replace the removed component checks. Earlier notes, complete dated receipts and archived gaps retain their original scopes.",
        "Audit3460 historical original active selectors (verbatim JSON values; not current coverage):\ncommands: [\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-native-text-forwarder.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-macos-keybinding-dict-trace.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-linux-fcitx4-trace-replay.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-xterm-resumed-preedit-visibility.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-composer-placeholder-mask.test.ts src/shared/terminal/input/terminal-composer-draft.test.ts src/main/daemon/emulation/testing/terminal-cursor-line-context.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/dashboard-popout/preview-terminal-ime-bridge-kitty-bytes.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/dashboard-popout/AgentTerminalPreview.test.tsx src/shared/terminal/protocol/input-modes/terminal-kitty-keyboard-mode-tracker.test.ts src/main/ipc/terminal-preview-output-stream.test.ts src/main/daemon/providers/adapter/testing/daemon-pty-adapter.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/keyboard/terminal-option-kitty-release.test.ts src/main/ipc/macos-keyboard-layout-change-notifications.test.ts src/preload/app-restart-checkpoint-routing.test.ts src/renderer/src/web/web-preload-api-ui.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm run test:e2e -- tests/e2e/chinese-ime-chat-input-repro.spec.ts\",\n        \"pnpm run test:e2e -- tests/e2e/terminal-korean-endofrow-preedit-cell-span.spec.ts tests/e2e/terminal-korean-midline-preedit-occlusion.spec.ts\",\n        \"pnpm run test:e2e -- tests/e2e/terminal-option-composed-ascii.spec.ts\"\n      ]\ntestFiles: [\n        \"tests/e2e/terminal-option-composed-ascii.spec.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-native-text-forwarder.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-macos-keybinding-dict-trace.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-linux-fcitx4-trace-replay.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-xterm-resumed-preedit-visibility.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-composer-placeholder-mask.test.ts\",\n        \"src/shared/terminal/input/terminal-composer-draft.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/daemon/emulation/testing/terminal-cursor-line-context.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/keyboard/terminal-option-kitty-release.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/ipc/macos-keyboard-layout-change-notifications.test.ts\",\n        \"src/preload/app-restart-checkpoint-routing.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/web/web-preload-api-ui.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/dashboard-popout/preview-terminal-ime-bridge-kitty-bytes.test.ts\",\n        \"src/renderer/src/components/dashboard-popout/AgentTerminalPreview.test.tsx\",\n        \"src/shared/terminal/protocol/input-modes/terminal-kitty-keyboard-mode-tracker.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/ipc/terminal-preview-output-stream.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/daemon/providers/adapter/testing/daemon-pty-adapter.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/e2e/chinese-ime-chat-input-repro.spec.ts\",\n        \"tests/e2e/terminal-korean-endofrow-preedit-cell-span.spec.ts\",\n        \"tests/e2e/terminal-korean-midline-preedit-occlusion.spec.ts\"\n      ]\nassertionRefs: [\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-linux-fcitx4-trace-replay.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"real fcitx4 Sogou captures (GTK module and XIM) send only the committed candidate for Space and digit picks, under legacy keys and kitty flags 1 and 5\",\n            \"a real fcitx4 Google Pinyin in-client preedit still commits through the composition path\",\n            \"an XIM pick's code-less keydown pairs with its keyup so kitty event reporting sends one release per pick\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/ime/terminal-ime-xterm-resumed-preedit-visibility.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\"A transaction inferred from update alone commits and cleans up.\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"tests/e2e/terminal-option-composed-ascii.spec.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"a live kitty-negotiated pane receives the Option-composed ASCII character, not the physical alt chord\",\n            \"an Option layer that also needs Shift still reaches the pty as text\",\n            \"configured Option-as-Alt still reports the layout-resolved physical chord\",\n            \"a non-ASCII Option glyph still reaches the application as its alt hotkey\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/input/keyboard/terminal-option-kitty-release.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"Autorepeat cannot replace the first release sender; a fresh press can replace an orphaned sender for the same key.\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/main/ipc/macos-keyboard-layout-change-notifications.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"rapid input-source changes coalesce to one latest-generation refresh signal\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/preload/app-restart-checkpoint-routing.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"macOS keyboard reads and the change subscription remain wired after main integration\",\n            \"the two-phase change payload reaches the renderer unchanged\",\n            \"the subscription disposer removes the exact IPC listener\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/dashboard-popout/preview-terminal-ime-bridge-kitty-bytes.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"the real forwarder behind the Preview bridge encodes the commit from the snapshot-proven flags before any live output\",\n            \"flags 0/1 commit raw text, flags 2 add one CSI-u release, flags 8 emit one CSI-u press, and flags 10 emit a CSI-u press followed by exactly one release\",\n            \"both keydown->insertText->keyup and keydown->keyup->insertText orderings produce the same bytes\",\n            \"the release is emitted by the forwarder while xterm's internal kitty flags stay 0\",\n            \"the mutable flags getter is read exactly once, at commit time, never on keydown or keyup\",\n            \"auto-repeat, two-key rollover, a swallowed commit, a retired claim, blur, and disposal each emit at most one release and never synthesize one\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/components/dashboard-popout/AgentTerminalPreview.test.tsx\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"the Preview hands the forwarder the live kitty mirror seeded from the snapshot's proven flags\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/shared/terminal/protocol/input-modes/terminal-kitty-keyboard-mode-tracker.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"a fresh PTY's known 0 is distinguishable from a snapshot's unproven 0 fallback\",\n            \"restoreSnapshotFlags proves only the active screen\",\n            \"provenance survives absolute sets, screen switches, RIS and DECSTR, but a pop past omitted push history returns to unknown rather than a manufactured 0\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/main/ipc/terminal-preview-output-stream.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"a partially covered sequenced chunk retains exactly its unseen suffix in live mode\",\n            \"a transformed overlap remains unsliced in replay mode\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"tests/e2e/chinese-ime-chat-input-repro.spec.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"Sogou-style Space candidate selection submits only the committed Chinese character\",\n            \"Sogou-style digit candidate selection submits only the committed Chinese phrase\",\n            \"Post-composition Sogou-style digit selection stays out of the PTY after compositionend\",\n            \"Legacy orphaned-letter-keyup digit selection submits no selector byte to the PTY; real legacy candidate commit preservation remains a platform gap\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"tests/e2e/terminal-korean-endofrow-preedit-cell-span.spec.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"the rendered final-column preedit caret remains inside the terminal screen\",\n            \"a rendered full-width Korean preedit spans materially more than the one terminal cell reported in #12729\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"tests/e2e/terminal-korean-midline-preedit-occlusion.spec.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"the rendered opaque overlay reproduces every committed row-tail cell its measured rectangle hides\",\n            \"a real Codex placeholder with bold prompt, blank footer gap, model footer, and cursor at column 2 stays masked\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]",
        "Preload layout cleanup retires the complete mocked macOS keyboard bridge registration. Its API-read forwarding, two-phase payload forwarding and exact listener-disposer alarms are intentionally lost without equivalent replacement. The remaining restart/checkpoint registrations do not cover this IME contract. Unaffected dated receipts retain their original commands and scope; this metadata change claims no new execution. Retired assertion reference: {\"file\":\"src/preload/app-restart-checkpoint-routing.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"macOS keyboard reads and the change subscription remain wired after main integration\",\"the two-phase change payload reaches the renderer unchanged\",\"the subscription disposer removes the exact IPC listener\"]}"
      ],
      "demotionRule": "Cannot promote if success is based only on DOM text without PTY byte/cell evidence."
