thority on command completion and exit; forgets synthetic handles when disconnected PTY records are pruned. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/headless-snapshots.spec.ts: returns OSC titles from headless main terminal snapshots; adopts renderer-seeded titles into headless main terminal snapshots; returns cwd metadata from seeded headless main terminal snapshots; adopts OSC7 host metadata from seeded headless terminal scrollback; falls back to the renderer snapshot for hidden-output recovery without headless state; keeps an empty headless snapshot authoritative for hidden-output recovery; advances the absolute output sequence across a daemon stream gap; emits explicit OSC 9999 agent status from runtime PTY data. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-side-effect-facts-part-02.spec.ts: falls back to the provider snapshot for a restored PTY with no mounted renderer; falls back to the available mirror when authoritative provider history is unavailable; keeps an empty renderer snapshot when the provider has no retained content; keeps restored provider history authoritative after later live output; uses provider alternate-screen state while a partial model is unsafe; prefers the tracked title over the headless emulator lastTitle; keeps the cursor-agent literal in record-fallback snapshots only without a tracker title; touches mobile snapshots once for decorative spinner ticks, again on idle. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/local-worktree-creation-part-02.spec.ts: creates a same-repo PR branch override from a resolved head SHA and matching push target; skips broad remote fetch for an existing full-SHA PR base; creates a selected Bitbucket PR branch override from a matching remote branch; suffixes an existing PR when a matching push target lacks selected PR metadata; suffixes a matching push target branch when selected PR metadata has no PR number; suffixes a matching push target branch when the existing PR is different; suffixes a selected PR remote conflict when the PR lookup fails; checks out an unused runtime PR branch only when it is at the resolved head SHA; suffixes only the runtime worktree path when an exact PR branch checkout path exists. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/local-worktree-creation.spec.ts: returns runtime local base update suggestions from addWorktree; creates a runtime local worktree from a usable persisted local branch base; does not create a runtime local worktree when the refresh fails and no local base ref exists; creates a branchNameOverride worktree from the selected matching remote base ref. Current changed source bytes, wrapper registrations and reduced selectors have no fresh execution or red/green credit. Unrelated surviving receipt objects keep their original narrow scope; current literal graph reachability does not establish historical import closure or equivalent replacement coverage. Current conservative command/import graph reaches src/main/runtime/construction/orca-runtime.test.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/targeting-and-resilience.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-removal-and-reconciliation-part-04.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-removal-and-reconciliation-part-03.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-removal-and-reconciliation-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/gitlab-and-pr-bases-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/gitlab-and-pr-bases.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-setup-and-startup-part-03.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-setup-and-startup.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-sleep-and-teardown-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-summaries-part-03.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-summaries-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-summaries.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-creation-and-orchestration-part-03.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca