        "Audit2133 current-parent preparation (988 authored removals; independently reviewed2099/2107/2115/2116 decisions; upstream clear-buffer and recovery-image regressions retained): Intentionally retire these low-value alarms without replacement: src/main/runtime/orchestration/mailbox/terminal-pointer/orchestration-mailbox-delivery.test.ts: remove only literal registration import/call pairs import './orchestration-mailbox-pointer-cli-command.spec'; no additional authored credit. src/main/runtime/construction/orca-runtime.test.ts: remove only literal registration import/call pairs await import('../orca-runtime-tests/worktree-setup-and-startup.spec'), await import('../orca-runtime-tests/gitlab-and-pr-bases.spec'); no additional authored credit. src/main/runtime/orchestration/mailbox/routing/orchestration-mailbox-detached-routing.spec.ts: uses bounded ownership lookup for direct arrivals while the agent cannot take input; wakes a bound Run waiter when same-Run direct mail arrives; keeps an unowned detached-recipient message in its direct mailbox; uses primary-key lookups for bounded routing updates. src/main/runtime/orchestration/mailbox/terminal-pointer/orchestration-mailbox-pointer-cli-command.spec.ts: renders the %s CLI command in a mailbox pointer. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/targeting-and-resilience.spec.ts: routes tab switch and capture start by explicit page id; accepts focus on tab switch without altering bridge args (focus is main-side concern); keeps terminal cwd resolution fail-soft when the provider is unavailable. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-removal-and-reconciliation-part-04.spec.ts: drops the bounded scan cache when orphan-cleanup removal completes; clears optimistic reconcile tokens when a CLI worktree removal succeeds; emits drift without mutating when the fetched base fast-forwards created HEAD; emits base_changed without mutation when the fetched base rewrote history; skips stale-token reconciles without mutating or emit