thority on command completion and exit; forgets synthetic handles when disconnected PTY records are pruned. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/headless-snapshots.spec.ts: returns OSC titles from headless main terminal snapshots; adopts renderer-seeded titles into headless main terminal snapshots; returns cwd metadata from seeded headless main terminal snapshots; adopts OSC7 host metadata from seeded headless terminal scrollback; falls back to the renderer snapshot for hidden-output recovery without headless state; keeps an empty headless snapshot authoritative for hidden-output recovery; advances the absolute output sequence across a daemon stream gap; emits explicit OSC 9999 agent status from runtime PTY data. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-side-effect-facts-part-02.spec.ts: falls back to the provider snapshot for a restored PTY with no mounted renderer; falls back to the available mirror when authoritative provider history is unavailable; keeps an empty renderer snapshot when the provider has no retained content; keeps restored provider history authoritative after later live output; uses provider alternate-screen state while a partial model is unsafe; prefers the tracked title over the headless emulator lastTitle; keeps the cursor-agent literal in record-fallback snapshots only without a tracker title; touches mobile snapshots once for decorative spinner ticks, again on idle. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/local-worktree-creation-part-02.spec.ts: creates a same-repo PR branch override from a resolved head SHA and matching push target; skips broad remote fetch for an existing full-SHA PR base; creates a selected Bitbucket PR branch override from a matching remote branch; suffixes an existing PR when a matching push target lacks selected PR metadata; suffixes a matching push target branch when selected PR metadata has no PR number; suffixes a matching push target branch when the existing PR is different; suffixes a selected PR remote conflict when the PR lookup fails; checks out an unused runtime PR branch only when it is at the resolved head SHA; suffixes only the runtime worktree path when an exact PR branch checkout path exists. src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/local-worktree-creation.spec.ts: returns runtime local base update suggestions from addWorktree; creates a runtime local worktree from a usable persisted local branch base; does not create a runtime local worktree when the refresh fails and no local base ref exists; creates a branchNameOverride worktree from the selected matching remote base ref. tests/e2e/claude-agent-row-view.unit.test.ts: updates a mounted compact workflow description through the subscribed production parent; bounds upstream active-SSH visits for $population records, fallback=$fallback; derives %s destinations without requiring type or a workflow child ID; terminates a $path parent $status with no third request or intermediate toast; does not recover a first child %s. tests/e2e/cross-version-wire/agent-permission-legacy-spawn.unit.test.ts: keeps exact legacy ordering when structured creation cannot express afterTabId; can create a terminal without selecting the target worktree; preserves the legacy fresh-agent path when host authority is unavailable. tests/e2e/paired-instant-browser-tab.spec.ts: shows a paired browser tab before its create RPC resolves, then keeps it as one tab; adopts a paired browser tab without rebuilding its chrome. tests/e2e/session-tabs-decorative-title-fanout.unit.test.ts: bounds host publication and renderer application across remote worktrees; globally caps decorative freshness while every working status stays fresh. tests/e2e/session-tabs/mobile-session-active-performance.unit.test.ts: bounds saved-order publication selection at N and 10N without rematerializing navigation; bounds admitted placement reconciliation during supported reads at N and 10N; bounds selection input visits at 50 and 500 rows, including unavailable-target projection; keeps publication scoped to a changed worktree and shared by listeners at N and 10N; bounds preserved-chat merge and runtime-owned hydration at N and 10N (legacy=%s); bounds actual native retirement and shared delivery work at N and 10N. tests/e2e/session-tabs/mobile-session-active-publication.unit.test.ts: does not substitute a preserved row for an unavailable explicit legacy selection; resolves main-layout group selection %s (omitted group=%s). tests/e2e/structured-agent-session-launch-admission.unit.test.ts: opens a direct caller's terminal with the caller's own CLI arguments on a decline; opens the chat on the server that admitted it; opens only the terminal when this machine declines, without a notice; opens a new agent tab's terminal with the typed prompt when the caller names none; opens the chat, not a terminal, when this machine cannot resolve a new workspace yet; keeps its terminal fallback, as before. tests/e2e/structured-attention-prompt-relay.unit.test.ts: settles once per relayed prompt, not on every later status update. tests/e2e/structured-attention-read-retirement.unit.test.ts: Mark read on a chat never opened withdraws the prompt alert it surfaced; Mark read on a chat hidden since an earlier view covers the newer prompt it surfaced; reads a newly accepted visible prompt without sending an RPC for text-only updates. tests/e2e/structured-chat-tab-lifetime-cost.unit.test.ts: counts real raw stores, unrelated window publications and captured cleanup at %i chats; counts complete supplied-member sweep and separate final retirement at S=%i N=%i. tests/e2e/structured-session-workspace-authority.unit.test.ts: bounds actual target reveal across %i repo roots and metadata aliases. tests/e2e/terminal-agent-pane-launch.unit.test.ts: starts the host's planned command once, at the pane's size, and says it started; plans a pane whose prompt the window submits without the startup update prompt; preserves caller shell-ready delivery only for a connection-scoped adapter ($connectionId); starts no shell on plan failure (original failure: $returnLaunchFailure); cannot confirm a start whose provider answer was lost. tests/e2e/terminal-parked-memory.spec.ts: releases renderer terminal memory when hidden tabs park. tests/e2e/terminal-shortcuts.spec.ts: @headful Codex-like background output stays visible without disabling WebGL in auto mode; Shift with Russian layout text reaches the PTY as Cyrillic under kitty keyboard reporting. tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency.spec.ts: records attributed CWD, spawn, bind, fixture-ready, input, and echo phases. tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency-phases.ts: dedicated zero-case helper retirement; no authored test credit. tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency-main-probe.ts: dedicated zero-case helper retirement; no authored test credit. tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency-artifact.ts: dedicated zero-case helper retirement; no authored test credit. tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency-report.ts: dedicated zero-case helper retirement; no authored test credit. tests/e2e/terminal-tab-switch-visual-restore.spec.ts: restores skipped hidden Grok output on light tab resume. tests/e2e/web-runtime-session-terminal-host-authority.unit.test.ts: delivers independent %s effort through the real prepared web callback; keeps same-ID local and runtime worktrees on the selected runtime owner; creates paired web agents through host authority so activation is mirrored; delivers generated continuation context after host-authoritative creation; seeds the chat composer for a draft that rode in on the launch command. Current changed source bytes, wrapper registrations and reduced selectors have no fresh execution or red/green credit. Unrelated surviving receipt objects keep their original narrow scope; current literal graph reachability does not establish historical import closure or equivalent replacement coverage. Current conservative command/import graph reaches src/main/runtime/construction/orca-runtime.test.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/targeting-and-resilience.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-removal-and-reconciliation-part-04.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-removal-and-reconciliation-part-03.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-removal-and-reconciliation-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/gitlab-and-pr-bases-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/gitlab-and-pr-bases.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-setup-and-startup-part-03.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/worktree-setup-and-startup.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-sleep-and-teardown-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-summaries-part-03.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-summaries-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-summaries.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-creation-and-orchestration-part-03.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-creation-and-orchestration-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-part-13.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-part-12.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-part-11.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-part-10.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-part-08.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-part-07.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-part-05.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-part-04.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/mobile-session-tabs.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-handles-and-agent-status-part-05.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-handles-and-agent-status-part-04.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-handles-and-agent-status-part-03.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-handles-and-agent-status-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-handles-and-agent-status.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-output-and-worker-recovery-part-07.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-output-and-worker-recovery-part-04.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-output-and-worker-recovery-part-03.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-output-and-worker-recovery-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-12.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-11.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-10.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-09.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-08.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-07.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-06.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness-part-03.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-creation-and-readiness.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/headless-snapshots.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/terminal-side-effect-facts-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/local-worktree-creation-part-02.spec.ts, src/main/runtime/orca-runtime-tests/local-worktree-creation.spec.ts, tests/e2e/claude-agent-row-view.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/cross-version-wire/agent-permission-legacy-spawn.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/paired-instant-browser-tab.spec.ts, tests/e2e/session-tabs-decorative-title-fanout.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/session-tabs/mobile-session-active-performance.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/session-tabs/mobile-session-active-publication.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/structured-agent-session-launch-admission.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/structured-attention-prompt-relay.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/structured-attention-read-retirement.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/structured-chat-tab-lifetime-cost.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/structured-session-workspace-authority.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-agent-pane-launch.unit.test.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-parked-memory.spec.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-shortcuts.spec.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency.spec.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency-phases.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency-main-probe.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency-artifact.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-split-activation-latency-report.ts, tests/e2e/terminal-tab-switch-visual-restore.spec.ts, tests/e2e/web-runtime-session-terminal-host-authority.unit.test.ts. Unresolved local/computed edges remain explicit debt.",
        "Audit2145 accepts removal of canned runtime metadata/guard/forwarding, fake in-memory persistence, private work-count and wrapper-duplication tests from the construction/orca-runtime.test.ts aggregate, plus the two automation run-context guards from runtime-workspace-launch-contracts.test.ts. Retained race, framing, physical completion and ownership callbacks remain byte-identical. Existing commands remain valid selectors; historical receipts stay unchanged and provide no fresh validation or replacement coverage for the reduced suites.",
        "Audit3390 composes root-adopted3382/independent3383 and3386/independent3387 and3388/independent3389: intentionally retires216 authored registrations/230 expanded cases in42 whole authored suites plus5 zero-case registration drivers, without equivalent replacement. Lost local alarms include fake PTY identity/routing/startup/replay/mode/title/mouse/IME/scroll matrices, broad startup identity and file-open wiring, mock mailbox title recovery, mobile row parity and whole-v-selective save parity. Retained24 registrations/26 expanded cases in22 suites preserve actual xterm Windows buffer/wrap/scroll, typed TOML scalar, real Promise cancellation/settlement, HTTP Codex scanner/projector semantics, durable recovery admission/newer-schema bytes, federation completion/ACK/SQLite atomicity and failed stale-run-write versus imported durable history. Additional retained clock-domain scheduling, durable freeze/ACK/checkpoint ordering, ABA dirty intent, SQL atomicity, folder-domain retier/last-note deletion, scrollback durable no-sync staging, PanelBridge subscriber lifetime and reserved-send publication preserve narrower concrete behaviors. Current finite owner drift assessed in bounded defining bodies; retained callback bytes unchanged. Historical notes and complete dated receipts keep their original exact scopes. No new execution, equivalent replacement, native focus/device/pixel, live remote or global mixed-version guarantee is claimed.\nOriginal active selector fields (historical raw native JSON values; not current coverage):\ncommands: [\n        \"ORCA_BACKGROUND_LAUNCH=1 npx vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check-worker-federated-attachment.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/cli/handlers/orchestration.test.ts src/cli/handlers/orchestration-check-identity.test.ts src/cli/handlers/orchestration-worker-cli.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/worker/composed-workers.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/send.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-rejection.test.ts src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-json-rejection.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/federation/federation.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/federation/federation-lifecycle-settlement.test.ts --reporter=dot\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/orchestration/db/federation/federation-acknowledgment-migration.test.ts --reporter=dot\",\n        \"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/construction/orca-runtime.test.ts\",\n        \"pnpm run test:e2e -- tests/e2e/orchestration-worker-terminal-visibility.spec.ts --workers=1\",\n        \"pnpm run build:cli && SKIP_BUILD=1 pnpm exec playwright test tests/e2e/orchestration-worker-settlement-release-cli.spec.ts --config tests/playwright.config.ts --project electron-headless --workers=1\"\n      ]\ntestFiles: [\n        \"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check-worker-federated-attachment.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/runtime/construction/orca-runtime.test.ts\",\n        \"src/cli/handlers/orchestration.test.ts\",\n        \"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-rejection.test.ts\",\n        \"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-json-rejection.test.ts\",\n        \"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-check-identity.test.ts\",\n        \"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-worker-cli.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/worker/composed-workers.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/send.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/federation/federation.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/federation/federation-lifecycle-settlement.test.ts\",\n        \"src/main/runtime/orchestration/db/federation/federation-acknowledgment-migration.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/e2e/orchestration-worker-terminal-visibility.spec.ts\",\n        \"tests/e2e/orchestration-worker-settlement-release-cli.spec.ts\"\n      ]\nassertionRefs: [\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check-worker-federated-attachment.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"replays the coordinator instruction and takes its ack after the app restarts\",\n            \"files loopback mail once under the local Dispatch Run without replacing its owner\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-rejection.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"an explicit current worker_done verdict completes without a compatibility read\",\n            \"a worker_done response without a lifecycle verdict checks the exact authoritative Dispatch and report receipt\",\n            \"legacy succeeded and failed reports require matching terminal Task and Dispatch state\",\n            \"stopped or stale Dispatches cannot impersonate report settlement\",\n            \"an idempotent retry accepts the first authoritative report from the same worker\",\n            \"a Run-home relay rejection reaches the CLI error boundary\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-json-rejection.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\"a rejected lifecycle verdict is emitted as a JSON ok=false envelope\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-check-identity.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"implicit check carries the caller pane key with a potentially stale environment handle\",\n            \"explicit legacy terminal inspection does not inherit the caller pane key\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"Run delivery resolves through a stable coordinator pane after handle remint\",\n            \"a live handle cannot be retargeted by mismatched pane metadata\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/send.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"Dispatch delivery resolves through a stable worker pane after handle remint\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/federation/federation-lifecycle-settlement.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"a remote worker_done waits for Run-home settlement even when an older CLI omits the wait hint\",\n            \"a current Run home still completes reports from legacy protocol v1/v2 worker servers\",\n            \"persisted protocol v1/v2 workers retain legacy-compatible completion after their worker server updates\",\n            \"preexisting same-outcome terminal ACK batches settle atomically while conflicting outcomes acknowledge nothing\",\n            \"an aborted settlement wait returns operation_unknown instead of accepted success\",\n            \"a Run-home terminal verdict settles the remote attachment and revokes its capability\",\n            \"a terminal verdict cannot settle an unrelated relay item\",\n            \"a terminal verdict cannot contradict the exact queued worker report outcome\",\n            \"a rejected report replays its exact verdict without mutating durable rejection mail twice\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"src/main/runtime/orchestration/db/federation/federation-acknowledgment-migration.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"a v26 database gains a zeroed durable home-to-worker acknowledgment watermark\",\n            \"a complete v26 database starts migration at v26 rather than replaying v7-v26\",\n            \"the migration advances schema version without losing the imported relay cursor\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"tests/e2e/orchestration-worker-terminal-visibility.spec.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"worker-start exposes one inactive worker tab before workspace navigation\",\n            \"the coordinator tab remains active\",\n            \"ACK delivery reaches a stable coordinator pane through a stale handle\",\n            \"one spawn remains live with no interruption event\",\n            \"PTY/incarnation, tab, leaf, worktree, Task, and Dispatch identities remain stable\",\n            \"workspace re-entry does not duplicate the worker tab or print Conversation interrupted\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"file\": \"tests/e2e/orchestration-worker-settlement-release-cli.spec.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"a compiled CLI worker_done with the wrong identity exits nonzero with ok=false\",\n            \"the exact Task and Dispatch remain dispatched after rejection\",\n            \"the correct worker identity receives an explicit completed lifecycle verdict\",\n            \"an independent runtime read observes the Dispatch completed\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]",
        "Audit3403 composes root-adopted3393/3394,3400/3401 and3398/3399: intentionally retires167 authored registrations/196 potential expanded cases across93 whole suites without equivalent replacement or fresh execution. Retained65 registrations/79 potential cases include one conditional missing-input failure sentinel; potential counts are not executions. Historical notes and complete dated receipts retain their exact original scopes. The retained runtime registration driver loses three complete imported fragments: changed-working-label title facts and suppressed-frame tracked snapshots; refusing SSH GitLab MR-base lookup before local Git/glab calls; and missing folder-workspace path creation/update refusal before spawn/store mutation. These alarms are intentionally lost. Other imported fragments and separately rooted dated receipts are unchanged; they are not equivalent replacement coverage.  Original scope text is retained as the exact suffix of coverageNotes/oracle; historical evidence is unchanged.",
        "Audit3429 composes root-adopted3426/independent3427: intentionally removes168 authored/205 potential expanded cases across16 semantic sources, deleting11 whole suites and one304line unused assertion helper. Five authored/five potential cases remain; the duplicate500k graph row is dropped while its50k row and callback remain. No equivalent replacement or fresh execution is claimed. The complete federation-lifecycle-settlement suite is removed, losing its fake remote settlement/protocol/acknowledgment examples. Its exact standalone command, testFiles entry and complete assertionRef are retired and prior fields archived. Existing receipts select unrelated migration and compiled CLI journeys and retain original scopes.  All prior notes and dated/archived evidence retain original scopes.",
        "Complete prior commands before federation-lifecycle suite retirement: [\"ORCA_BACKGROUND_LAUNCH=1 npx vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check-worker-federated-attachment.test.ts\",\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/cli/handlers/orchestration.test.ts src/cli/handlers/orchestration-check-identity.test.ts src/cli/handlers/orchestration-worker-cli.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/worker/composed-workers.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check.test.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/send.test.ts\",\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-rejection.test.ts src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-json-rejection.test.ts\",\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/federation/federation.test.ts\",\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/federation/federation-lifecycle-settlement.test.ts --reporter=dot\",\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/orchestration/db/federation/federation-acknowledgment-migration.test.ts --reporter=dot\",\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/runtime/construction/orca-runtime.test.ts\",\"pnpm run test:e2e -- tests/e2e/orchestration-worker-terminal-visibility.spec.ts --workers=1\",\"pnpm run build:cli && SKIP_BUILD=1 pnpm exec playwright test tests/e2e/orchestration-worker-settlement-release-cli.spec.ts --config tests/playwright.config.ts --project electron-headless --workers=1\"]",
        "Complete prior testFiles before federation-lifecycle suite retirement: [\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check-worker-federated-attachment.test.ts\",\"src/main/runtime/construction/orca-runtime.test.ts\",\"src/cli/handlers/orchestration.test.ts\",\"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-rejection.test.ts\",\"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-json-rejection.test.ts\",\"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-check-identity.test.ts\",\"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-worker-cli.test.ts\",\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/worker/composed-workers.test.ts\",\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check.test.ts\",\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/send.test.ts\",\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/federation/federation.test.ts\",\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/federation/federation-lifecycle-settlement.test.ts\",\"src/main/runtime/orchestration/db/federation/federation-acknowledgment-migration.test.ts\",\"tests/e2e/orchestration-worker-terminal-visibility.spec.ts\",\"tests/e2e/orchestration-worker-settlement-release-cli.spec.ts\"]",
        "Complete prior assertionRefs before federation-lifecycle suite retirement: [{\"file\":\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check-worker-federated-attachment.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"replays the coordinator instruction and takes its ack after the app restarts\",\"files loopback mail once under the local Dispatch Run without replacing its owner\"]},{\"file\":\"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-rejection.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"an explicit current worker_done verdict completes without a compatibility read\",\"a worker_done response without a lifecycle verdict checks the exact authoritative Dispatch and report receipt\",\"legacy succeeded and failed reports require matching terminal Task and Dispatch state\",\"stopped or stale Dispatches cannot impersonate report settlement\",\"an idempotent retry accepts the first authoritative report from the same worker\",\"a Run-home relay rejection reaches the CLI error boundary\"]},{\"file\":\"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-lifecycle-json-rejection.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"a rejected lifecycle verdict is emitted as a JSON ok=false envelope\"]},{\"file\":\"src/cli/handlers/orchestration-check-identity.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"implicit check carries the caller pane key with a potentially stale environment handle\",\"explicit legacy terminal inspection does not inherit the caller pane key\"]},{\"file\":\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/check.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"Run delivery resolves through a stable coordinator pane after handle remint\",\"a live handle cannot be retargeted by mismatched pane metadata\"]},{\"file\":\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/messaging/send.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"Dispatch delivery resolves through a stable worker pane after handle remint\"]},{\"file\":\"src/main/runtime/rpc/methods/orchestration/federation/federation-lifecycle-settlement.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"a remote worker_done waits for Run-home settlement even 