      "coverageNotes": "Audit1391 intentionally deletes or reduces the listed sources. No fresh execution result validates their reduced selectors. Historical coverage account: Local macOS evidence over the merged #7133/#7173 restore and hidden-output ordering tests on main@1282f5c2d. The dirty-state exactness contract, normal-buffer clear semantics, and metadata-only replay remain pending-stack work. Audit1391: src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection-remote-pause-drop-notice.spec.ts reduced. Lose repeated quiet switches avoiding snapshots and legacy host without drop-report capability requesting a snapshot. Retained imported registrar uses fake transport/xterm writes, exercising real gap/restore lifecycle rather than actual terminal rendering. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed.",
