        "Audit1302: src/main/runtime/rpc/terminal-multiplex-ack-output-budget.test.ts: Keep production RPC dispatcher/terminal framing with emitted binary bytes, UTF-8 reconstruction and client ACK releasing genuinely withheld output; also keep the direct binary-subscribe chunk boundary. Remove shared-budget fairness matrix that sleeps real time and relies on exact synthetic per-stream window scheduling. Lose that eight-stream fairness/call wiring alarm; no equivalent replacement. Reduced selectors require fresh validation; prior full-suite receipts do not validate removed or changed coverage. No equivalent replacement or physical-provider claim.",
