d back from; labels the launch with the build the adoption found serving, not the stale record; defers while another run holds the host fence; lets an explicit force deploy past both skips; names a newer host refusal apart from a rolled-back one, so only Force is offered; updates an older host as before, without asking to adopt it; never asks the incumbent when it already runs this build. src/renderer/src/components/agent/agent-launch-picker-acquisition.test.ts: keeps a completed listing usable when the host rejects the wait parameter. src/renderer/src/components/feature-tips/feature-tip-telemetry.test.ts: delivers to chat-default users in all targeting while holding out not-switched users. src/renderer/src/components/native-chat/composer/pickers/use-native-chat-side-chat-command.test.ts: completes the row on a pick, even when the command is already typed; ignores a pick of the row while side chats are unavailable. src/renderer/src/components/native-chat/media/images/native-chat-image-copy.test.ts: explains a too-large refusal that arrives through the IPC error prefix. src/renderer/src/components/native-chat/messages/actions/native-chat-fork-launch.test.ts: keeps the question with the caller and says once that it never went; tells the user to check the side chat when delivery is unconfirmed; reports a delivered question as sent, silently. src/renderer/src/components/native-chat/messages/actions/native-chat-side-chat-fork-point.test.ts: decides each of %i tool-only turns once per layout, and nothing without a listener. src/renderer/src/components/native-chat/messages/actions/use-native-chat-fork.test.tsx: places a side chat whose question was %s: %o. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/provider-notices/agent-presence/agent-terminal-presence.test.ts: calls back once for %s; stops watching once unsubscribed. src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/pty-connection/emulation/pty-connection-mode2031-raw-subscription.spec.ts: records a mode 2031 subscribe from the r