      "coverageNotes": "Audit1400 intentionally deletes or reduces the listed sources. No fresh execution result validates their reduced selectors. Historical coverage account: A deterministic renderer ordering test covers stale initial snapshots independently by target and stream, including hydration after partial SSH authority reconciliation. Headed macOS Electron tests force the same startup hydration race and use an ephemeral Docker sshd, a real remote Git worktree, real remote Node listeners, real HTTP forwards, in-place relay and full transport reconnect restoration, collision rejection, scan refresh, explicit removal, and an unrelated surviving forward through both transports. The forced-system run requires a recorded OpenSSH -L invocation. Audit1400: src/main/ipc/ssh/ssh.test.ts reduced. Lose trivial missing target and mocked publication inventory. Preexisting unresolved ../ssh/ssh-port-scanner mock is recorded, not fixed. No equivalent replacement coverage is claimed.",
