        "Audit3362 historical original commands object, preserved verbatim; retired source claims are not active evidence or replacement coverage:\n\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/parking/output-watchers/terminal-parked-tab-watchers.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/layout/split/terminal-pane-split-request-routing.test.ts src/renderer/src/components/terminal-pane/parking/lifecycle/use-terminal-tab-cold-parking.test.ts src/renderer/src/hooks/ipc-events/terminal-ui-routing-ipc-bridge-split.test.ts src/main/runtime/terminal/layout/orca-runtime-terminal-split-authority.test.ts src/renderer/src/runtime/sync-runtime-graph/sync-runtime-graph-parked-leaf.test.ts src/renderer/src/runtime/hosted-terminals/recovery/web-session-terminal-orphan-mixed-version.test.ts src/renderer/src/runtime/hosted-terminals/recovery/web-session-terminal-orphan-recovery.test.ts src/renderer/src/runtime/hosted-terminals/recovery/web-session-terminal-orphan-recovery-regressions.test.ts src/renderer/src/runtime/hosted-terminals/recovery/adoption/web-session-terminal-orphan-recovery-adoption-regressions.test.ts src/renderer/src/runtime/hosted-terminals/recovery/panes/web-session-terminal-pending-handle-recovery.test.ts tests/e2e/host-cold-park-remote-subscriber.unit.test.ts --reporter=dot\"",
        "Audit3362 historical original testFiles object, preserved verbatim; retired source claims are not active evidence or replacement coverage:\n\"src/renderer/src/runtime/hosted-terminals/recovery/adoption/web-session-terminal-orphan-recovery-adoption-regressions.test.ts\"",
        "Audit3362 historical original assertionRefs object, preserved verbatim; retired source claims are not active evidence or replacement coverage:\n{\n          \"file\": \"src/renderer/src/runtime/hosted-terminals/recovery/adoption/web-session-terminal-orphan-recovery-adoption-regressions.test.ts\",\n          \"assertions\": [\n            \"retries a transient thrown adoption on an unchanged semantic frame\",\n            \"retains the client epoch and retries when the post-adoption list has $failure\",\n            \"preserves prior terminal bindings after a post-adoption $failure and retries\",\n            \"merges host-projected $verdict sibling state after adoption without treating pending as exited\",\n            \"does not apply an adoption result after the local tab closes while adoption is blocked\",\n            \"does not apply an adoption result after the local tab moves groups while adoption is blocked\"\n          ]\n        }",
        "Audit3456 composes ROOT-adopted3449/independent3450: intentionally removes62 authored/82 potential expanded cases from16 selected drivers, including7 whole suites, while13 authored/13 potential cases remain. Delete the unused48line legacy workspace-session JSON fixture with zero test credit. These are source-only reductions without equivalent replacement or fresh runtime claims. The paired serve-restart file loses only the expensive automation-run-ID restart case. Its original terminal journey remains byte-identical: daemon/fixture process identity survives replacement serve, keyboard/output/grid/history/checkpoint converge and authoritative close removes the binding. LAYOUT_OWNER_BUILD gates its pending-handle assertion. Existing dated receipt objects and assertion references retain their original terminal-journey scope and provide no fresh validation of the reduced file selector. All prior notes and archived receipts retain original scopes."
