        "Audit1556 demotes this gate to protection none after retiring its complete passed receipt. Selector and assertion inventory retained here as historical only; current retained tests remain in the unit suite. {\"commands\":[\"ORCA_BACKGROUND_LAUNCH=1 pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/cli/runtime/serve-signal-exit-diagnostic.test.ts src/main/browser/backends/offscreen-browser-backend-lifecycle.test.ts src/main/browser/agent-browser/agent-browser-bridge-tab-routing.test.ts src/main/startup/serve-signal-handlers.test.ts --maxWorkers=2\",\"pnpm exec vitest run --config config/vitest.config.ts src/main/browser src/main/updater/browser-sidecar-owner.test.ts\"],\"testFiles\":[\"src/main/browser/backends/offscreen-browser-backend-lifecycle.test.ts\",\"src/main/browser/agent-browser/agent-browser-bridge-tab-routing.test.ts\",\"src/main/startup/serve-signal-handlers.test.ts\",\"src/cli/runtime/serve-signal-exit-diagnostic.test.ts\"],\"assertionRefs\":[{\"file\":\"src/main/startup/serve-signal-handlers.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"every repeated serve signal retries Electron quit after a possible renderer veto\",\"SIGINT and SIGTERM listeners remain installed during quit draining\"]},{\"file\":\"src/cli/runtime/serve-signal-exit-diagnostic.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"serve supervisor force-kill grace covers renderer acknowledgement, committed teardown, and scheduling margin\",\"Windows shared-console Ctrl-C is not forwarded as an immediate child termination\"]},{\"file\":\"src/main/browser/backends/offscreen-browser-backend-lifecycle.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"same-ID replacement survives old window closure after awaited retirement\",\"shutdown joins owner retirement already started by unexpected renderer destruction\"]},{\"file\":\"src/main/browser/agent-browser/agent-browser-bridge-tab-routing.test.ts\",\"assertions\":[\"unpinned references from a different page snapshot are refused until current page is snapshotted\"]}]}",
        "Audit1556 removes the whole mocked helper session lifecycle suite and reduces offscreen lifecycle and tab-routing suites. Mock helper argv/route/concurrency, private active state, explicit unregister ordering, standalone renderer-destroy notification and debugger-detach alarms are retired without equivalent replacement. Remaining offscreen cases prove same-ID replacement preservation and shutdown joining pending retirement against injected windows/manager/helper dependencies. The retained tab-routing case proves snapshot-reference provenance against injected helper replies. Reduced reliability commands have no fresh cohort/native receipt; this batch ran its ten retained authored cases plus two unchanged imported allowlist cases only.",
