        "evidence": "Audit1400 changed referenced test sources; no new red/green validation. Historical account: The affected implementation cached the disconnected layout before host acknowledgment and suppressed the identical retry; the merged oracle keeps only successful remote pushes deduplicated and the observer receives the retried title."
