fects suites. This gate retains an unfiltered root Vitest command admitting these paths. Accepted losses are same-account linked-row success-notice fanout, sidebar-switch channel forwarding, Linear-only notification forwarding/non-terminal-consumer selection/closed-window detach, destroyed-window refusal and first-send-failure suspension through the pane-title adapter, the100-card synthetic focus/poll absence sample, stored-source local folder badge refresh, unobserved-row badge refusal, and immediate reposChanged lineage invalidation. These exercise real owners with controlled ports; they are retired for marginal value, without equivalent replacement claims. The no-badge-work fixture does not seed its title-promised collection-only cache. Preserved historical receipts do not validate deleted or reduced drivers; no fresh execution is claimed. Audit3759 retires the entire one-case Tailwind compiler/scanner smoke. Accept loss of the direct CSS production/test/spec source-exclusion and rescan alarm; no replacement or current execution is claimed. Audit3752 independently approves audit3749: retire five authored/five finite watcher-process registrations, retaining18 raw-exact registrations. Accept loss of healthy shared-pool joint recovery, last-pending-failure idle retirement/respawn, late VITEST fallback release, missing-entry fail-closed selection and independent-supervisor fuse locality alarms. These are real bounded host-policy alarms intentionally retired for low marginal value; no equivalent replacement is asserted. Remaining driver selections exercise controlled FakeChild supervisor lifecycle, cancellation, physical-exit fencing, recovery and fuse behavior. This source review supplies no fresh native/process/platform/remote/SSH execution; historical receipts retain original source and selector scopes. Audits3738/3742/3743/3744 intentionally remove15 authored/21 finite registrations from six surviving drivers, with no equivalent replacement or fresh execution clai