      "coveredPlatforms": [],
      "coveredProviders": [],
      "coverageNotes": "Audit2133 current-parent preparation: Current reduced sources/selectors intentionally retire the alarms listed in knownGaps; prior dated runs and replacement claims do not validate the changed set. Audit2095 current-parent preparation2126: Current reduced sources/selectors intentionally retire the alarms listed in knownGaps; prior dated runs and replacement claims do not validate the changed set. Audit2090 (sources2088/2089): Current reduced suites intentionally retire the alarms listed in knownGaps; prior dated execution and replacement claims do not validate changed source bytes or selectors. NEXT136 retired affected callbacks and complete execution receipts. No equivalent fresh execution, provider/platform scope, soak or measured-budget credit is claimed.",
      "motivatingLinks": [
